// V66 authored narrative. Include before legacy localization records.
// Third field preserves old source keys; it is never displayed.
{TEXT("老兵把六支 SMLE 带上火线。\n六人步枪班，适合占领战壕、接替守军。开阔地上的机枪与炮火能迅速削弱整班兵力。"),TEXT("Six SMLEs and the men to hold a trench.\nA six-man rifle section for taking ground and relieving defenders. Machine guns and shellfire can cut it down in the open.")},
{TEXT("老兵把六支 SMLE 带上火线。\n六人步枪班，适合占领战壕、接替守军。开阔地上的机枪与炮火能迅速削弱整班兵力。"),TEXT("Six SMLEs and the men to hold a trench.\nA six-man rifle section for taking ground and relieving defenders. Machine guns and shellfire can cut it down in the open."),TEXT("六把 SMLE 在胸墙上排开。步枪班适合占壕和补充战线；穿越空地时，远处机枪是主要威胁。\n编制：6人。")},
{TEXT("老兵把六支 SMLE 带上火线。\n六人步枪班，适合占领战壕、接替守军。开阔地上的机枪与炮火能迅速削弱整班兵力。"),TEXT("Six SMLEs and the men to hold a trench.\nA six-man rifle section for taking ground and relieving defenders. Machine guns and shellfire can cut it down in the open."),TEXT("Six SMLEs line the parapet. Riflemen take trenches and fill gaps in the line; distant machine guns threaten an open crossing.\nSection: 6 men.")},
{TEXT("Gewehr 98 守住白垩坡上的长射界。\n六人步枪班，适合据壕射击。射程略长于英军，射击间隔也更长；推进时需要火力掩护。"),TEXT("Gewehr 98s command the long chalk approaches.\nA six-man rifle section suited to trench defence. Its rifles outrange the British slightly, with a slower firing cycle. Advances need covering fire.")},
{TEXT("Gewehr 98 守住白垩坡上的长射界。\n六人步枪班，适合据壕射击。射程略长于英军，射击间隔也更长；推进时需要火力掩护。"),TEXT("Gewehr 98s command the long chalk approaches.\nA six-man rifle section suited to trench defence. Its rifles outrange the British slightly, with a slower firing cycle. Advances need covering fire."),TEXT("Gewehr 98 的枪口伸出胸墙。步枪班适合守住长射界，再随掩护向前换位；射击节奏慢于英军步枪。\n编制：6人，射程略长于英军。")},
{TEXT("Gewehr 98 守住白垩坡上的长射界。\n六人步枪班，适合据壕射击。射程略长于英军，射击间隔也更长；推进时需要火力掩护。"),TEXT("Gewehr 98s command the long chalk approaches.\nA six-man rifle section suited to trench defence. Its rifles outrange the British slightly, with a slower firing cycle. Advances need covering fire."),TEXT("Gewehr 98 muzzles project over the parapet. Riflemen hold long approaches and advance under cover; they fire more slowly than British rifles.\nSection: 6 men, with slightly longer rifle range.")},
{TEXT("弹盘送到枪旁，刘易斯守住通路。\n一名机枪手与两名步枪手。架设后以远射和压制掩护步兵；转移、换盘会中断射击，精确射手威胁枪手。"),TEXT("A fresh drum beside the Lewis, an approach under its sights.\nOne machine gunner and two riflemen. Deployed fire covers infantry at range. Moving and reloading interrupt fire; marksmen threaten the gunner.")},
{TEXT("弹盘送到枪旁，刘易斯守住通路。\n一名机枪手与两名步枪手。架设后以远射和压制掩护步兵；转移、换盘会中断射击，精确射手威胁枪手。"),TEXT("A fresh drum beside the Lewis, an approach under its sights.\nOne machine gunner and two riflemen. Deployed fire covers infantry at range. Moving and reloading interrupt fire; marksmen threaten the gunner."),TEXT("刘易斯的弹盘在枪架上转动。固定枪组以远射和压制掩护步兵；搬动、换盘和敌方精确射击会打断火力。\n编制：1挺机枪、2名步枪手。")},
{TEXT("弹盘送到枪旁，刘易斯守住通路。\n一名机枪手与两名步枪手。架设后以远射和压制掩护步兵；转移、换盘会中断射击，精确射手威胁枪手。"),TEXT("A fresh drum beside the Lewis, an approach under its sights.\nOne machine gunner and two riflemen. Deployed fire covers infantry at range. Moving and reloading interrupt fire; marksmen threaten the gunner."),TEXT("The Lewis drum turns above its support. A fixed gun section covers infantry with range and suppression; movement, reloading and enemy marksmen interrupt its fire.\nCrew: 1 machine gun and 2 riflemen.")},
{TEXT("MG 08/15 的弹带穿过枪组手中。\n一名机枪手与两名步枪手。架设后以持续点射封锁通路；转移较慢，烟幕与炮击能压住枪位。"),TEXT("An MG 08/15 crew feeds another belt.\nOne machine gunner and two riflemen. Sustained bursts close an approach once deployed. Slow to move and vulnerable to smoke and shellfire.")},
{TEXT("MG 08/15 的弹带穿过枪组手中。\n一名机枪手与两名步枪手。架设后以持续点射封锁通路；转移较慢，烟幕与炮击能压住枪位。"),TEXT("An MG 08/15 crew feeds another belt.\nOne machine gunner and two riflemen. Sustained bursts close an approach once deployed. Slow to move and vulnerable to smoke and shellfire."),TEXT("弹带穿过 MG 08/15 的机匣。固定枪组用长点射封锁通路；架设和搬运较慢，烟幕与炮火能压住枪位。\n编制：1挺机枪、2名步枪手。")},
{TEXT("MG 08/15 的弹带穿过枪组手中。\n一名机枪手与两名步枪手。架设后以持续点射封锁通路；转移较慢，烟幕与炮击能压住枪位。"),TEXT("An MG 08/15 crew feeds another belt.\nOne machine gunner and two riflemen. Sustained bursts close an approach once deployed. Slow to move and vulnerable to smoke and shellfire."),TEXT("A belt feeds through the MG 08/15. The fixed section closes an approach with sustained bursts; it takes time to deploy and is vulnerable to smoke and shellfire.\nCrew: 1 machine gun and 2 riflemen.")},
{TEXT("Mills 手雷先越过壕角。\n四人投弹班，擅长近距离清壕。手雷也能损伤履带，散布会危及附近友军；接近时需要掩护。"),TEXT("The Mills bomb goes over the traverse first.\nFour bombers for close trench fighting. Their grenades can damage tracks, but scattered throws endanger nearby allies. They need cover on the approach.")},
{TEXT("Mills 手雷先越过壕角。\n四人投弹班，擅长近距离清壕。手雷也能损伤履带，散布会危及附近友军；接近时需要掩护。"),TEXT("The Mills bomb goes over the traverse first.\nFour bombers for close trench fighting. Their grenades can damage tracks, but scattered throws endanger nearby allies. They need cover on the approach."),TEXT("Mills 手雷越过壕角。投弹班近距离清理守军，也能损伤坦克履带；落点有散布，友军须避开投掷区。\n编制：4人。")},
{TEXT("Mills 手雷先越过壕角。\n四人投弹班，擅长近距离清壕。手雷也能损伤履带，散布会危及附近友军；接近时需要掩护。"),TEXT("The Mills bomb goes over the traverse first.\nFour bombers for close trench fighting. Their grenades can damage tracks, but scattered throws endanger nearby allies. They need cover on the approach."),TEXT("Mills bombs pass over the traverse. Bombers clear close trenches and can damage tank tracks; scattered throws also endanger friendly troops.\nSection: 4 men.")},
{TEXT("柄式手榴弹为突击手打开壕口。\n四人突击班，擅长近距离清壕，也能威胁履带。远处机枪可阻断接近，烟幕有助于缩短距离。"),TEXT("Stick grenades open the trench for the assault party.\nFour men for close trench fighting, with grenades that can threaten tracks. Distant machine guns can stop their approach; smoke helps them close.")},
{TEXT("柄式手榴弹为突击手打开壕口。\n四人突击班，擅长近距离清壕，也能威胁履带。远处机枪可阻断接近，烟幕有助于缩短距离。"),TEXT("Stick grenades open the trench for the assault party.\nFour men for close trench fighting, with grenades that can threaten tracks. Distant machine guns can stop their approach; smoke helps them close."),TEXT("柄式手榴弹先越过胸墙。突击班擅长近壕交战，也能威胁履带；接近途中需要烟幕或机枪掩护。\n编制：4人。")},
{TEXT("柄式手榴弹为突击手打开壕口。\n四人突击班，擅长近距离清壕，也能威胁履带。远处机枪可阻断接近，烟幕有助于缩短距离。"),TEXT("Stick grenades open the trench for the assault party.\nFour men for close trench fighting, with grenades that can threaten tracks. Distant machine guns can stop their approach; smoke helps them close."),TEXT("Stick grenades cross the parapet first. Assault men excel in close trenches and can threaten tracks; smoke or covering fire helps them survive the approach.\nSection: 4 men.")},
{TEXT("枪声之间，射手辨认敌方机枪的闪光。\n一名精确射手与一名步枪观察手。优先打击机枪；烟雾、压制和近敌会妨碍瞄准。"),TEXT("Between shots, the marksman watches for a gun flash.\nOne marksman and one rifle-armed spotter. Prioritises machine gunners. Smoke, suppression and close attacks disrupt aim.")},
{TEXT("枪声之间，射手辨认敌方机枪的闪光。\n一名精确射手与一名步枪观察手。优先打击机枪；烟雾、压制和近敌会妨碍瞄准。"),TEXT("Between shots, the marksman watches for a gun flash.\nOne marksman and one rifle-armed spotter. Prioritises machine gunners. Smoke, suppression and close attacks disrupt aim."),TEXT("射手在胸墙上找到了机枪的闪光，身旁的观察手守住近处。稳定瞄准克制固定枪位；烟幕、压制和近敌会打断优势。\n编制：1名精确射手、1名普通步枪观察手。")},
{TEXT("枪声之间，射手辨认敌方机枪的闪光。\n一名精确射手与一名步枪观察手。优先打击机枪；烟雾、压制和近敌会妨碍瞄准。"),TEXT("Between shots, the marksman watches for a gun flash.\nOne marksman and one rifle-armed spotter. Prioritises machine gunners. Smoke, suppression and close attacks disrupt aim."),TEXT("The marksman finds a gun flash while his spotter watches the close ground. Steady aim counters fixed guns; smoke, suppression and close attacks break the advantage.\nPair: one marksman and one service-rifle spotter.")},
{TEXT("挑选出的步枪交给最沉稳的射手。\n一名精确射手与一名步枪观察手。优先打击机枪，转换目标后需重新瞄准；近战能力有限。"),TEXT("A selected rifle for a steady shot.\nOne marksman and one rifle-armed spotter. Prioritises machine gunners and must settle after changing targets. Vulnerable at close range.")},
{TEXT("挑选出的步枪交给最沉稳的射手。\n一名精确射手与一名步枪观察手。优先打击机枪，转换目标后需重新瞄准；近战能力有限。"),TEXT("A selected rifle for a steady shot.\nOne marksman and one rifle-armed spotter. Prioritises machine gunners and must settle after changing targets. Vulnerable at close range."),TEXT("挑选出的步枪守住长射界，观察手带着制式步枪警戒。精确射手优先对付机枪，转移目标需要重新稳住瞄准。\n编制：1名精确射手、1名普通步枪观察手。")},
{TEXT("挑选出的步枪交给最沉稳的射手。\n一名精确射手与一名步枪观察手。优先打击机枪，转换目标后需重新瞄准；近战能力有限。"),TEXT("A selected rifle for a steady shot.\nOne marksman and one rifle-armed spotter. Prioritises machine gunners and must settle after changing targets. Vulnerable at close range."),TEXT("A selected rifle watches the long approach; a service-rifle spotter guards its flank. The marksman prioritises machine guns and must settle before changing aim.\nPair: one marksman and one service-rifle spotter.")},
{TEXT("军士的口令沿壕传开。\n附近友军命中率提高 25%，同类指挥不叠加。停步时每 8 秒缓解附近压制；军士阵亡、受重压或离队后失效。\n金星标记军士，银星标记受指挥分队。"),TEXT("The sergeant's order passes down the trench.\nNearby allies gain 25% accuracy; command bonuses do not stack. While halted, he rallies them every 8 seconds. Death, heavy suppression or separation ends his command.\nGold marks the leader; silver marks sections under orders.")},
{TEXT("军士的口令沿壕传开。\n附近友军命中率提高 25%，同类指挥不叠加。停步时每 8 秒缓解附近压制；军士阵亡、受重压或离队后失效。\n金星标记军士，银星标记受指挥分队。"),TEXT("The sergeant's order passes down the trench.\nNearby allies gain 25% accuracy; command bonuses do not stack. While halted, he rallies them every 8 seconds. Death, heavy suppression or separation ends his command.\nGold marks the leader; silver marks sections under orders."),TEXT("军士沿壕传下口令。指挥组提高附近友军命中率，并在停步后缓解压制；组长阵亡、受重压或远离部队时，指挥加成失效。\n战术：命中率+25%，不叠加；每8秒重整。金星为指挥者，银星为受益分队。")},
{TEXT("军士的口令沿壕传开。\n附近友军命中率提高 25%，同类指挥不叠加。停步时每 8 秒缓解附近压制；军士阵亡、受重压或离队后失效。\n金星标记军士，银星标记受指挥分队。"),TEXT("The sergeant's order passes down the trench.\nNearby allies gain 25% accuracy; command bonuses do not stack. While halted, he rallies them every 8 seconds. Death, heavy suppression or separation ends his command.\nGold marks the leader; silver marks sections under orders."),TEXT("The sergeant passes an order down the trench. His section improves nearby aim and rallies troops while halted; death, heavy suppression or separation ends the command bonus.\nTactics: +25% accuracy, no stacking; rally every 8 seconds. Gold marks the leader, silver the affected sections.")},
{TEXT("军士穿过交通壕，重新接起各处枪位。\n附近友军命中率提高 25%，同类指挥不叠加。停步时每 8 秒缓解附近压制；军士阵亡、受重压或离队后失效。\n金星标记军士，银星标记受指挥分队。"),TEXT("The NCO brings the scattered posts back under command.\nNearby allies gain 25% accuracy; command bonuses do not stack. While halted, he rallies them every 8 seconds. Death, heavy suppression or separation ends his command.\nGold marks the leader; silver marks sections under orders.")},
{TEXT("军士穿过交通壕，重新接起各处枪位。\n附近友军命中率提高 25%，同类指挥不叠加。停步时每 8 秒缓解附近压制；军士阵亡、受重压或离队后失效。\n金星标记军士，银星标记受指挥分队。"),TEXT("The NCO brings the scattered posts back under command.\nNearby allies gain 25% accuracy; command bonuses do not stack. While halted, he rallies them every 8 seconds. Death, heavy suppression or separation ends his command.\nGold marks the leader; silver marks sections under orders."),TEXT("军士把口令送到相邻枪位。指挥组提高附近友军命中率，停步后缓解压制；失去组长或让他陷入重压都会中断指挥。\n战术：命中率+25%，不叠加；每8秒重整。金星为指挥者，银星为受益分队。")},
{TEXT("军士穿过交通壕，重新接起各处枪位。\n附近友军命中率提高 25%，同类指挥不叠加。停步时每 8 秒缓解附近压制；军士阵亡、受重压或离队后失效。\n金星标记军士，银星标记受指挥分队。"),TEXT("The NCO brings the scattered posts back under command.\nNearby allies gain 25% accuracy; command bonuses do not stack. While halted, he rallies them every 8 seconds. Death, heavy suppression or separation ends his command.\nGold marks the leader; silver marks sections under orders."),TEXT("The NCO carries an order between gun posts. His section improves nearby aim and rallies troops while halted; losing the leader or pinning him down breaks command.\nTactics: +25% accuracy, no stacking; rally every 8 seconds. Gold marks the leader, silver the affected sections.")},
{TEXT("法军喷火手把 Schilt 带到壕口。\n喷流威胁近处掩体，射程与燃料有限。操作手较能承受零星枪火，爆炸命中仍然致命；储罐可能被引燃。"),TEXT("A French flame detachment brings its Schilt to the trench mouth.\nThe jet threatens close cover, with limited reach and fuel. The operator withstands scattered rifle fire better, but a blast remains fatal and can ignite the reservoir.")},
{TEXT("法军喷火手把 Schilt 带到壕口。\n喷流威胁近处掩体，射程与燃料有限。操作手较能承受零星枪火，爆炸命中仍然致命；储罐可能被引燃。"),TEXT("A French flame detachment brings its Schilt to the trench mouth.\nThe jet threatens close cover, with limited reach and fuel. The operator withstands scattered rifle fire better, but a blast remains fatal and can ignite the reservoir."),TEXT("Schilt 操作手在壕口打开阀门。喷流清理近处掩体，燃料和射程有限；爆炸能当场击杀操作手并引燃储罐。\n操作手较能承受零星枪火，仍需步兵掩护。")},
{TEXT("法军喷火手把 Schilt 带到壕口。\n喷流威胁近处掩体，射程与燃料有限。操作手较能承受零星枪火，爆炸命中仍然致命；储罐可能被引燃。"),TEXT("A French flame detachment brings its Schilt to the trench mouth.\nThe jet threatens close cover, with limited reach and fuel. The operator withstands scattered rifle fire better, but a blast remains fatal and can ignite the reservoir."),TEXT("The Schilt operator opens the valve at the trench mouth. The jet clears nearby cover but has limited fuel and reach; a blast can kill the operator and ignite his reservoir.\nThe operator withstands scattered rifle fire better, but still needs infantry cover.")},
{TEXT("Wex 操作手沿胸墙接近。\n喷流威胁近处掩体，射程与燃料有限。操作手较能承受零星枪火，爆炸命中仍然致命。烟幕能掩护接近，储罐可能被引燃。"),TEXT("The Wex operator closes along the parapet.\nThe jet threatens close cover, with limited reach and fuel. The operator withstands scattered rifle fire better, but a blast remains fatal. Smoke covers the approach; the reservoir can ignite.")},
{TEXT("Wex 操作手沿胸墙接近。\n喷流威胁近处掩体，射程与燃料有限。操作手较能承受零星枪火，爆炸命中仍然致命。烟幕能掩护接近，储罐可能被引燃。"),TEXT("The Wex operator closes along the parapet.\nThe jet threatens close cover, with limited reach and fuel. The operator withstands scattered rifle fire better, but a blast remains fatal. Smoke covers the approach; the reservoir can ignite."),TEXT("Wex 储罐贴着壕壁前移。喷流清理近处掩体，烟幕有助于接近；燃料有限，爆炸可能引燃储罐。\n操作手较能承受零星枪火，爆炸仍可当场击杀。")},
{TEXT("Wex 操作手沿胸墙接近。\n喷流威胁近处掩体，射程与燃料有限。操作手较能承受零星枪火，爆炸命中仍然致命。烟幕能掩护接近，储罐可能被引燃。"),TEXT("The Wex operator closes along the parapet.\nThe jet threatens close cover, with limited reach and fuel. The operator withstands scattered rifle fire better, but a blast remains fatal. Smoke covers the approach; the reservoir can ignite."),TEXT("The Wex reservoir moves forward beside the trench wall. Its jet clears close cover, with smoke helping the approach; fuel is limited and blasts may ignite the tank.\nThe operator resists scattered rifle fire better, but a blast can still kill outright.")},
{TEXT("皇家工兵在铁丝间剪出通路。\n清除障碍，并在掩护下修筑工事。第 2 关起，停步施工 12 秒可筑成壕肩；两人驻守时，正面枪弹命中率降低 22%，炮火可摧毁工事。\n第 9 关起，可用 12 秒修复一侧履带至半数耐久，每侧限一次。近敌与压制会中断作业。"),TEXT("Royal Engineers cut a passage through the wire.\nClear obstacles and build cover. From operation 2, a 12-second halt builds a revetment. With two defenders, it reduces frontal bullet hit chance by 22%; shellfire can destroy it.\nFrom operation 9, a 12-second repair restores a track to half strength, once per side. Enemies and suppression interrupt work.")},
{TEXT("皇家工兵在铁丝间剪出通路。\n清除障碍，并在掩护下修筑工事。第 2 关起，停步施工 12 秒可筑成壕肩；两人驻守时，正面枪弹命中率降低 22%，炮火可摧毁工事。\n第 9 关起，可用 12 秒修复一侧履带至半数耐久，每侧限一次。近敌与压制会中断作业。"),TEXT("Royal Engineers cut a passage through the wire.\nClear obstacles and build cover. From operation 2, a 12-second halt builds a revetment. With two defenders, it reduces frontal bullet hit chance by 22%; shellfire can destroy it.\nFrom operation 9, a 12-second repair restores a track to half strength, once per side. Enemies and suppression interrupt work."),TEXT("皇家工兵把剪钳伸进铁丝。工兵清障、筑壕肩，后期可抢修坦克履带；近敌与压制会打断作业。\n第2关起：静止施工12秒；工事有2人驻防时，正面枪弹命中率降低22%，炮火可毁。第9关起：抢修12秒恢复一侧履带90/180，每侧限一次。")},
{TEXT("皇家工兵在铁丝间剪出通路。\n清除障碍，并在掩护下修筑工事。第 2 关起，停步施工 12 秒可筑成壕肩；两人驻守时，正面枪弹命中率降低 22%，炮火可摧毁工事。\n第 9 关起，可用 12 秒修复一侧履带至半数耐久，每侧限一次。近敌与压制会中断作业。"),TEXT("Royal Engineers cut a passage through the wire.\nClear obstacles and build cover. From operation 2, a 12-second halt builds a revetment. With two defenders, it reduces frontal bullet hit chance by 22%; shellfire can destroy it.\nFrom operation 9, a 12-second repair restores a track to half strength, once per side. Enemies and suppression interrupt work."),TEXT("Royal Engineers put their cutters into the wire. Sappers clear obstacles, build revetments and later repair tank tracks; nearby enemies and suppression interrupt work.\nFrom operation 2: build while stationary for 12s; 2 defenders give 22% less frontal bullet hit chance. Shellfire can destroy the work. From operation 9: a 12s repair restores one track to 90/180, once per side.")},
{TEXT("Pioniere 沿铁丝与未爆弹之间开路。\n清除障碍，并在掩护下修筑工事。第 2 关起，停步施工 12 秒可筑成壕肩；两人驻守时，正面枪弹命中率降低 22%，炮火可摧毁工事。\n第 9 关起，可用 12 秒修复一侧履带至半数耐久，每侧限一次。近敌与压制会中断作业。"),TEXT("Pioniere open a route through wire and unexploded shells.\nClear obstacles and build cover. From operation 2, a 12-second halt builds a revetment. With two defenders, it reduces frontal bullet hit chance by 22%; shellfire can destroy it.\nFrom operation 9, a 12-second repair restores a track to half strength, once per side. Enemies and suppression interrupt work.")},
{TEXT("Pioniere 沿铁丝与未爆弹之间开路。\n清除障碍，并在掩护下修筑工事。第 2 关起，停步施工 12 秒可筑成壕肩；两人驻守时，正面枪弹命中率降低 22%，炮火可摧毁工事。\n第 9 关起，可用 12 秒修复一侧履带至半数耐久，每侧限一次。近敌与压制会中断作业。"),TEXT("Pioniere open a route through wire and unexploded shells.\nClear obstacles and build cover. From operation 2, a 12-second halt builds a revetment. With two defenders, it reduces frontal bullet hit chance by 22%; shellfire can destroy it.\nFrom operation 9, a 12-second repair restores a track to half strength, once per side. Enemies and suppression interrupt work."),TEXT("Pioniere 沿铁丝剪出缺口。工兵清障、加固壕肩，后期可抢修履带；施工需要停步和友军掩护。\n第2关起：施工12秒；工事有2人驻防时，正面枪弹命中率降低22%，炮火可毁。第9关起：抢修12秒恢复一侧履带90/180，每侧限一次；近敌与压制会打断作业。")},
{TEXT("Pioniere 沿铁丝与未爆弹之间开路。\n清除障碍，并在掩护下修筑工事。第 2 关起，停步施工 12 秒可筑成壕肩；两人驻守时，正面枪弹命中率降低 22%，炮火可摧毁工事。\n第 9 关起，可用 12 秒修复一侧履带至半数耐久，每侧限一次。近敌与压制会中断作业。"),TEXT("Pioniere open a route through wire and unexploded shells.\nClear obstacles and build cover. From operation 2, a 12-second halt builds a revetment. With two defenders, it reduces frontal bullet hit chance by 22%; shellfire can destroy it.\nFrom operation 9, a 12-second repair restores a track to half strength, once per side. Enemies and suppression interrupt work."),TEXT("Pioniere cut a gap through the wire. They clear obstacles, reinforce revetments and later repair tracks; work requires a halt and covering fire.\nFrom operation 2: build for 12s; 2 defenders give 22% less frontal bullet hit chance. Shellfire can destroy the work. From operation 9: a 12s repair restores one track to 90/180, once per side; enemies and suppression interrupt it.")},
{TEXT("No.23 枪榴弹落向胸墙后方。\n一名枪榴弹射手与两名步枪手。适合打击固定枪位和聚集步兵；散布较大，难以追击分散移动的目标。"),TEXT("A No.23 rifle grenade drops behind the parapet.\nOne rifle grenadier and two riflemen. Suited to fixed guns and infantry concentrations; wide scatter makes dispersed moving targets difficult to hit.")},
{TEXT("No.23 枪榴弹落向胸墙后方。\n一名枪榴弹射手与两名步枪手。适合打击固定枪位和聚集步兵；散布较大，难以追击分散移动的目标。"),TEXT("A No.23 rifle grenade drops behind the parapet.\nOne rifle grenadier and two riflemen. Suited to fixed guns and infantry concentrations; wide scatter makes dispersed moving targets difficult to hit."),TEXT("No.23 枪榴弹越过壕角。枪榴弹组压制固定阵位；散布较大，不善于追打奔跑的散兵。\n编制：1名枪榴弹射手、2名步枪手。")},
{TEXT("No.23 枪榴弹落向胸墙后方。\n一名枪榴弹射手与两名步枪手。适合打击固定枪位和聚集步兵；散布较大，难以追击分散移动的目标。"),TEXT("A No.23 rifle grenade drops behind the parapet.\nOne rifle grenadier and two riflemen. Suited to fixed guns and infantry concentrations; wide scatter makes dispersed moving targets difficult to hit."),TEXT("A No.23 rifle grenade passes over the traverse. The team suppresses fixed positions; broad scatter makes running stragglers poor targets.\nSection: 1 rifle grenadier and 2 riflemen.")},
{TEXT("Tankgewehr 的长枪管架上土堤。\n两人反坦克枪组，逐发攻击车体与履带。距离近、入射角正时更易击穿；装填慢，需步兵掩护。"),TEXT("The Tankgewehr rests on an earth bank.\nA two-man crew fires single shots at hulls and tracks. Close, square impacts penetrate more reliably. Slow to reload and dependent on infantry cover.")},
{TEXT("Tankgewehr 的长枪管架上土堤。\n两人反坦克枪组，逐发攻击车体与履带。距离近、入射角正时更易击穿；装填慢，需步兵掩护。"),TEXT("The Tankgewehr rests on an earth bank.\nA two-man crew fires single shots at hulls and tracks. Close, square impacts penetrate more reliably. Slow to reload and dependent on infantry cover."),TEXT("Tankgewehr 在土堤上架稳。反坦克组逐发射击车体与履带；装填缓慢，敌方步兵能逼近枪位。\n编制：2人。距离近、入射角正时更易击穿。")},
{TEXT("Tankgewehr 的长枪管架上土堤。\n两人反坦克枪组，逐发攻击车体与履带。距离近、入射角正时更易击穿；装填慢，需步兵掩护。"),TEXT("The Tankgewehr rests on an earth bank.\nA two-man crew fires single shots at hulls and tracks. Close, square impacts penetrate more reliably. Slow to reload and dependent on infantry cover."),TEXT("The Tankgewehr settles onto the earth bank. Its crew fires single shots at hulls and tracks; slow loading leaves time for enemy infantry to close.\nCrew: 2 men. Close, square hits penetrate more reliably.")},
{TEXT("狙击学校的镜瞄步枪送到前沿。\n一名狙击手与一名步枪观察手。以更远、更准的射击对付固定枪位；烟雾和压制妨碍瞄准，近战兵力不足。"),TEXT("A scoped rifle arrives from sniper school.\nOne sniper and one rifle-armed spotter. Greater range and accuracy threaten fixed guns. Smoke and suppression disrupt aim; the pair has little strength in close combat.")},
{TEXT("狙击学校的镜瞄步枪送到前沿。\n一名狙击手与一名步枪观察手。以更远、更准的射击对付固定枪位；烟雾和压制妨碍瞄准，近战兵力不足。"),TEXT("A scoped rifle arrives from sniper school.\nOne sniper and one rifle-armed spotter. Greater range and accuracy threaten fixed guns. Smoke and suppression disrupt aim; the pair has little strength in close combat."),TEXT("望远瞄准镜找到敌方枪口。狙击手擅长打击固定机枪，观察手近距掩护；人数少，烟雾和压制会打断瞄准。\n编制：1名狙击手、1名制式步枪观察手。")},
{TEXT("狙击学校的镜瞄步枪送到前沿。\n一名狙击手与一名步枪观察手。以更远、更准的射击对付固定枪位；烟雾和压制妨碍瞄准，近战兵力不足。"),TEXT("A scoped rifle arrives from sniper school.\nOne sniper and one rifle-armed spotter. Greater range and accuracy threaten fixed guns. Smoke and suppression disrupt aim; the pair has little strength in close combat."),TEXT("A telescopic sight finds the enemy gun. The sniper counters stationary machine guns while his rifle-armed spotter guards the approach. Smoke and suppression interrupt aim.\nPair: one sniper and one service-rifle spotter.")},
{TEXT("MP 18 的枪声追过下一道壕角。\n以自动火力和手雷争夺近壕。射程短，换弹时火力中断；远射与坦克能阻止突击。"),TEXT("MP 18 fire follows the assault round the traverse.\nAutomatic weapons and grenades excel in close trenches. Short range and reload pauses leave the section vulnerable to distant guns and tanks.")},
{TEXT("MP 18 的枪声追过下一道壕角。\n以自动火力和手雷争夺近壕。射程短，换弹时火力中断；远射与坦克能阻止突击。"),TEXT("MP 18 fire follows the assault round the traverse.\nAutomatic weapons and grenades excel in close trenches. Short range and reload pauses leave the section vulnerable to distant guns and tanks."),TEXT("MP 18 的短点射沿壕壁回响。风暴队以自动火力和手雷争夺近壕；射程短，换弹时需要掩护，无法独自对付坦克。")},
{TEXT("MP 18 的枪声追过下一道壕角。\n以自动火力和手雷争夺近壕。射程短，换弹时火力中断；远射与坦克能阻止突击。"),TEXT("MP 18 fire follows the assault round the traverse.\nAutomatic weapons and grenades excel in close trenches. Short range and reload pauses leave the section vulnerable to distant guns and tanks."),TEXT("Short MP 18 bursts echo along the trench wall. Storm troops contest close trenches with automatic fire and grenades; limited range and reload pauses leave them vulnerable to distant guns and tanks.")},
{TEXT("委任书送到前沿，军士接过 Webley。\n附近友军命中率提高 50%，同类指挥不叠加。停步时每 6 秒重整较大范围的友军。重压或军官阵亡会中断指挥。\n完成观察研习后，与一名同伴停稳 2 秒可为可见目标校射。"),TEXT("A commission reaches the front, and a Webley changes hands.\nNearby allies gain 50% accuracy without stacking. While halted, the officer rallies a wider area every 6 seconds. Heavy suppression or his death breaks command.\nAfter observation training, halt with an escort for 2 seconds to correct fire onto visible targets.")},
{TEXT("委任书送到前沿，军士接过 Webley。\n附近友军命中率提高 50%，同类指挥不叠加。停步时每 6 秒重整较大范围的友军。重压或军官阵亡会中断指挥。\n完成观察研习后，与一名同伴停稳 2 秒可为可见目标校射。"),TEXT("A commission reaches the front, and a Webley changes hands.\nNearby allies gain 50% accuracy without stacking. While halted, the officer rallies a wider area every 6 seconds. Heavy suppression or his death breaks command.\nAfter observation training, halt with an escort for 2 seconds to correct fire onto visible targets."),TEXT("军官在壕口向前队传令。附近友军得到更强指挥，停步后可缓解更大范围的压制；重压或失去组长会中断加成。\n战术：命中率+50%，不叠加；每6秒重整。观察研习后，携同伴停稳2秒可校射可见目标。Webley用于近身自卫。")},
{TEXT("委任书送到前沿，军士接过 Webley。\n附近友军命中率提高 50%，同类指挥不叠加。停步时每 6 秒重整较大范围的友军。重压或军官阵亡会中断指挥。\n完成观察研习后，与一名同伴停稳 2 秒可为可见目标校射。"),TEXT("A commission reaches the front, and a Webley changes hands.\nNearby allies gain 50% accuracy without stacking. While halted, the officer rallies a wider area every 6 seconds. Heavy suppression or his death breaks command.\nAfter observation training, halt with an escort for 2 seconds to correct fire onto visible targets."),TEXT("The officer carries orders to the leading section. He gives stronger command support and rallies a wider area while halted; heavy suppression or his death ends the bonus.\nTactics: +50% accuracy, no stacking; rally every 6s. With observation training and an escort, halt for 2s to correct visible targets. The Webley is for close defence.")},
{TEXT("军官随前队推进，以短促口令保持队形。\n附近友军命中率提高 50%，同类指挥不叠加。每 6 秒重整友军，行进中也可下令；范围略小于英军，重压会中断指挥。\n完成炮位测地研习后，与一名同伴停稳 2 秒可为可见目标校射。"),TEXT("The officer advances with the leading men, keeping them under orders.\nNearby allies gain 50% accuracy without stacking. He rallies every 6 seconds, even while moving. His reach is shorter than the British officer's; heavy suppression breaks command.\nAfter battery-survey training, halt with an escort for 2 seconds to correct visible targets.")},
{TEXT("军官随前队推进，以短促口令保持队形。\n附近友军命中率提高 50%，同类指挥不叠加。每 6 秒重整友军，行进中也可下令；范围略小于英军，重压会中断指挥。\n完成炮位测地研习后，与一名同伴停稳 2 秒可为可见目标校射。"),TEXT("The officer advances with the leading men, keeping them under orders.\nNearby allies gain 50% accuracy without stacking. He rallies every 6 seconds, even while moving. His reach is shorter than the British officer's; heavy suppression breaks command.\nAfter battery-survey training, halt with an escort for 2 seconds to correct visible targets."),TEXT("军官握着 P08 跟上前队。附近友军得到更强指挥，行进中也能重整部队；指挥范围略小于英军，重压会中断加成。\n战术：命中率+50%，不叠加；每6秒重整。炮位测地研习后，携同伴停稳2秒可校射可见目标。")},
{TEXT("军官随前队推进，以短促口令保持队形。\n附近友军命中率提高 50%，同类指挥不叠加。每 6 秒重整友军，行进中也可下令；范围略小于英军，重压会中断指挥。\n完成炮位测地研习后，与一名同伴停稳 2 秒可为可见目标校射。"),TEXT("The officer advances with the leading men, keeping them under orders.\nNearby allies gain 50% accuracy without stacking. He rallies every 6 seconds, even while moving. His reach is shorter than the British officer's; heavy suppression breaks command.\nAfter battery-survey training, halt with an escort for 2 seconds to correct visible targets."),TEXT("P08 in hand, the officer follows the advance. He gives stronger command support and can rally while moving; his reach is shorter than the British officer's, and heavy suppression breaks command.\nTactics: +50% accuracy, no stacking; rally every 6s. With battery-survey training and an escort, halt for 2s to correct visible targets.")},
{TEXT("Mark IV Male 以火炮和机枪支援步兵突破，也能迎击装甲。行驶缓慢，需要步兵清理附近战壕。野炮可毁伤车体，履带和机枪可单独损坏。"),TEXT("Mark IV Male supports breakthroughs with cannon and machine guns and can engage armour. Slow movement leaves it needing infantry to clear nearby trenches. Field guns threaten its hull; tracks and machine guns can be disabled separately.")},
{TEXT("Mark IV Male 以火炮和机枪支援步兵突破，也能迎击装甲。行驶缓慢，需要步兵清理附近战壕。野炮可毁伤车体，履带和机枪可单独损坏。"),TEXT("Mark IV Male supports breakthroughs with cannon and machine guns and can engage armour. Slow movement leaves it needing infantry to clear nearby trenches. Field guns threaten its hull; tracks and machine guns can be disabled separately."),TEXT("菱形履带碾过铁丝，侧舱炮朝向敌壕。\nMark IV 雄型以火炮和机枪支援突破，也能迎击装甲。行驶缓慢，需步兵清壕；野炮威胁车体，履带和机枪可单独损坏。")},
{TEXT("Mark IV Male 以火炮和机枪支援步兵突破，也能迎击装甲。行驶缓慢，需要步兵清理附近战壕。野炮可毁伤车体，履带和机枪可单独损坏。"),TEXT("Mark IV Male supports breakthroughs with cannon and machine guns and can engage armour. Slow movement leaves it needing infantry to clear nearby trenches. Field guns threaten its hull; tracks and machine guns can be disabled separately."),TEXT("Rhomboid tracks crush the wire; sponson guns cover the trench.\nThe Mark IV male supports breakthroughs and engages armour. Slow to advance and reliant on infantry to clear trenches. Field guns threaten its hull; tracks and machine guns can fail separately.")},
{TEXT("Mark IV Male 以火炮和机枪支援步兵突破，也能迎击装甲。行驶缓慢，需要步兵清理附近战壕。野炮可毁伤车体，履带和机枪可单独损坏。"),TEXT("Mark IV Male supports breakthroughs with cannon and machine guns and can engage armour. Slow movement leaves it needing infantry to clear nearby trenches. Field guns threaten its hull; tracks and machine guns can be disabled separately."),TEXT("Mark IV 雄型驶过铁丝。火炮与机枪支援缓慢突破，也能迎击装甲；占壕仍靠步兵，敌方野炮威胁车体。\n损伤：履带与机枪可单独损坏。")},
{TEXT("Mark IV Male 以火炮和机枪支援步兵突破，也能迎击装甲。行驶缓慢，需要步兵清理附近战壕。野炮可毁伤车体，履带和机枪可单独损坏。"),TEXT("Mark IV Male supports breakthroughs with cannon and machine guns and can engage armour. Slow movement leaves it needing infantry to clear nearby trenches. Field guns threaten its hull; tracks and machine guns can be disabled separately."),TEXT("A Mark IV male crosses the wire. Cannon and machine guns support a slow breakthrough and engage armour; infantry take the trenches while enemy field guns threaten the hull.\nDamage: tracks and machine guns can be disabled separately.")},
{TEXT("Whippet 移动较快，以机枪追击暴露步兵。没有反坦克炮，遭遇敌方装甲时需要炮兵支援。"),TEXT("Whippet moves quickly and pursues exposed infantry with machine guns. It has no anti-tank cannon and needs artillery support against enemy armour.")},
{TEXT("Whippet 移动较快，以机枪追击暴露步兵。没有反坦克炮，遭遇敌方装甲时需要炮兵支援。"),TEXT("Whippet moves quickly and pursues exposed infantry with machine guns. It has no anti-tank cannon and needs artillery support against enemy armour."),TEXT("Whippet 越过重型坦克留下的车辙。\n机动快，以机枪追击暴露步兵。没有反坦克炮，遇到敌方装甲时需要炮兵支援。")},
{TEXT("Whippet 移动较快，以机枪追击暴露步兵。没有反坦克炮，遭遇敌方装甲时需要炮兵支援。"),TEXT("Whippet moves quickly and pursues exposed infantry with machine guns. It has no anti-tank cannon and needs artillery support against enemy armour."),TEXT("The Whippet follows the heavy tanks' tracks.\nFast movement and machine guns suit pursuit of exposed infantry. It has no anti-tank cannon and needs gun support against enemy armour.")},
{TEXT("Whippet 移动较快，以机枪追击暴露步兵。没有反坦克炮，遭遇敌方装甲时需要炮兵支援。"),TEXT("Whippet moves quickly and pursues exposed infantry with machine guns. It has no anti-tank cannon and needs artillery support against enemy armour."),TEXT("Whippet 跟进步兵打开的缺口。机枪和机动适合追击步兵；缺少反装甲主炮，需要野炮或反坦克分队配合。")},
{TEXT("Whippet 移动较快，以机枪追击暴露步兵。没有反坦克炮，遭遇敌方装甲时需要炮兵支援。"),TEXT("Whippet moves quickly and pursues exposed infantry with machine guns. It has no anti-tank cannon and needs artillery support against enemy armour."),TEXT("A Whippet follows the breach opened by the infantry. Mobility and machine guns suit pursuit; without an anti-armour cannon, it needs field guns or tank-rifle teams against enemy armour.")},
{TEXT("A7V 以火炮迎击装甲，用多挺机枪压制步兵。车体笨重，需要步兵保护侧翼。野炮可毁伤车体，履带和机枪可单独损坏。"),TEXT("A7V engages armour with its cannon and suppresses infantry with several machine guns. Its bulky hull needs infantry on the flanks. Field guns threaten the hull; tracks and machine guns can be disabled separately.")},
{TEXT("A7V 以火炮迎击装甲，用多挺机枪压制步兵。车体笨重，需要步兵保护侧翼。野炮可毁伤车体，履带和机枪可单独损坏。"),TEXT("A7V engages armour with its cannon and suppresses infantry with several machine guns. Its bulky hull needs infantry on the flanks. Field guns threaten the hull; tracks and machine guns can be disabled separately."),TEXT("A7V 的炮口守住道路交叉口。\n火炮迎击装甲，多处机枪压制步兵。车体笨重，侧翼需友军掩护；履带和机枪可单独损坏，野炮能摧毁车体。")},
{TEXT("A7V 以火炮迎击装甲，用多挺机枪压制步兵。车体笨重，需要步兵保护侧翼。野炮可毁伤车体，履带和机枪可单独损坏。"),TEXT("A7V engages armour with its cannon and suppresses infantry with several machine guns. Its bulky hull needs infantry on the flanks. Field guns threaten the hull; tracks and machine guns can be disabled separately."),TEXT("An A7V covers the road junction.\nIts cannon engages armour and multiple guns suppress infantry. A cumbersome hull needs flank protection. Tracks and guns can fail separately; field artillery can destroy the vehicle.")},
{TEXT("A7V 以火炮迎击装甲，用多挺机枪压制步兵。车体笨重，需要步兵保护侧翼。野炮可毁伤车体，履带和机枪可单独损坏。"),TEXT("A7V engages armour with its cannon and suppresses infantry with several machine guns. Its bulky hull needs infantry on the flanks. Field guns threaten the hull; tracks and machine guns can be disabled separately."),TEXT("A7V 的枪口指向路口。火炮与机枪能压制步兵、迎击装甲；车体笨重，侧面需要友军掩护。\n损伤：野炮威胁车体，履带与机枪可单独损坏。")},
{TEXT("A7V 以火炮迎击装甲，用多挺机枪压制步兵。车体笨重，需要步兵保护侧翼。野炮可毁伤车体，履带和机枪可单独损坏。"),TEXT("A7V engages armour with its cannon and suppresses infantry with several machine guns. Its bulky hull needs infantry on the flanks. Field guns threaten the hull; tracks and machine guns can be disabled separately."),TEXT("An A7V covers the junction. Cannon and machine guns suppress infantry and fight armour; the cumbersome hull needs infantry on its flanks.\nDamage: field guns threaten the hull; tracks and machine guns can be disabled separately.")},
{TEXT("Captured Mark IV 修复后供德军使用，以火炮和机枪支援步兵。行驶缓慢，车体易受野炮和反坦克步枪攻击；履带和机枪可单独损坏。"),TEXT("Captured Mark IV serves German troops after repair, supporting infantry with cannon and machine guns. It moves slowly and its hull is vulnerable to field guns and tank rifles. Tracks and machine guns can be disabled separately.")},
{TEXT("Captured Mark IV 修复后供德军使用，以火炮和机枪支援步兵。行驶缓慢，车体易受野炮和反坦克步枪攻击；履带和机枪可单独损坏。"),TEXT("Captured Mark IV serves German troops after repair, supporting infantry with cannon and machine guns. It moves slowly and its hull is vulnerable to field guns and tank rifles. Tracks and machine guns can be disabled separately."),TEXT("德军识别十字覆盖了旧车号。\n缴获 Mark IV 以火炮和机枪支援步兵。行驶缓慢；野炮与反坦克步枪可毁伤车体，履带和枪位可单独损坏。")},
{TEXT("Captured Mark IV 修复后供德军使用，以火炮和机枪支援步兵。行驶缓慢，车体易受野炮和反坦克步枪攻击；履带和机枪可单独损坏。"),TEXT("Captured Mark IV serves German troops after repair, supporting infantry with cannon and machine guns. It moves slowly and its hull is vulnerable to field guns and tank rifles. Tracks and machine guns can be disabled separately."),TEXT("German crosses cover the old vehicle number.\nA captured Mark IV supports infantry with cannon and machine guns. Slow-moving and vulnerable to field guns and tank rifles. Tracks and gun positions can fail separately.")},
{TEXT("Captured Mark IV 修复后供德军使用，以火炮和机枪支援步兵。行驶缓慢，车体易受野炮和反坦克步枪攻击；履带和机枪可单独损坏。"),TEXT("Captured Mark IV serves German troops after repair, supporting infantry with cannon and machine guns. It moves slowly and its hull is vulnerable to field guns and tank rifles. Tracks and machine guns can be disabled separately."),TEXT("旧车体换上德军识别标记。缴获 Mark IV 以火炮与机枪伴随步兵推进；行驶缓慢，野炮和反坦克步枪仍能毁伤它。")},
{TEXT("Captured Mark IV 修复后供德军使用，以火炮和机枪支援步兵。行驶缓慢，车体易受野炮和反坦克步枪攻击；履带和机枪可单独损坏。"),TEXT("Captured Mark IV serves German troops after repair, supporting infantry with cannon and machine guns. It moves slowly and its hull is vulnerable to field guns and tank rifles. Tracks and machine guns can be disabled separately."),TEXT("German markings cover the old hull. A captured Mark IV supports infantry with cannon and machine guns; it moves slowly and remains vulnerable to field guns and anti-tank rifles.")},
{TEXT("Mark IV Female 以五挺 Lewis 机枪压制步兵，整备快于雄型，移动远慢于 Whippet。无法损伤敌方坦克车体；履带和机枪可单独损坏。各型装甲共用整备。"),TEXT("Mark IV Female suppresses infantry with five Lewis guns. It prepares sooner than the male but moves much more slowly than Whippet. It cannot damage tank hulls; tracks and machine guns can be disabled separately. Armour types share readiness.")},
{TEXT("Mark IV Female 以五挺 Lewis 机枪压制步兵，整备快于雄型，移动远慢于 Whippet。无法损伤敌方坦克车体；履带和机枪可单独损坏。各型装甲共用整备。"),TEXT("Mark IV Female suppresses infantry with five Lewis guns. It prepares sooner than the male but moves much more slowly than Whippet. It cannot damage tank hulls; tracks and machine guns can be disabled separately. Armour types share readiness."),TEXT("雌型 Mark IV 的五挺刘易斯扫过胸墙。\n重型机枪坦克，整备快于雄型，行驶远慢于 Whippet。无法损伤敌方坦克车体；履带与枪位可单独损坏。各型装甲共用整备。")},
{TEXT("Mark IV Female 以五挺 Lewis 机枪压制步兵，整备快于雄型，移动远慢于 Whippet。无法损伤敌方坦克车体；履带和机枪可单独损坏。各型装甲共用整备。"),TEXT("Mark IV Female suppresses infantry with five Lewis guns. It prepares sooner than the male but moves much more slowly than Whippet. It cannot damage tank hulls; tracks and machine guns can be disabled separately. Armour types share readiness."),TEXT("Five Lewis guns sweep the parapet from a female Mark IV.\nA heavy machine-gun tank, quicker to prepare than the male and much slower than a Whippet. Cannot damage enemy tank hulls. Tracks and guns can fail separately. All armour shares readiness.")},
{TEXT("Mark IV Female 以五挺 Lewis 机枪压制步兵，整备快于雄型，移动远慢于 Whippet。无法损伤敌方坦克车体；履带和机枪可单独损坏。各型装甲共用整备。"),TEXT("Mark IV Female suppresses infantry with five Lewis guns. It prepares sooner than the male but moves much more slowly than Whippet. It cannot damage tank hulls; tracks and machine guns can be disabled separately. Armour types share readiness."),TEXT("雌型车的矮侧舱扫过胸墙。重型车体和机枪适合压制守军，整备快于雄型；速度远慢于 Whippet，无法损伤敌方坦克车体。\n战术：5挺刘易斯；三种装甲共用整备。履带、枪位可单独损坏。")},
{TEXT("Mark IV Female 以五挺 Lewis 机枪压制步兵，整备快于雄型，移动远慢于 Whippet。无法损伤敌方坦克车体；履带和机枪可单独损坏。各型装甲共用整备。"),TEXT("Mark IV Female suppresses infantry with five Lewis guns. It prepares sooner than the male but moves much more slowly than Whippet. It cannot damage tank hulls; tracks and machine guns can be disabled separately. Armour types share readiness."),TEXT("The female tank's low sponsons rake the parapet. Its heavy hull and machine guns suppress defenders and prepare sooner than the male; it is much slower than a Whippet and cannot damage enemy tank hulls.\nTactics: 5 Lewis guns; all armour shares readiness. Tracks and gun mounts can fail separately.")},
{TEXT("Captured Mark IV Female 以五挺机枪压制密集步兵，整备快于火炮型。无法损伤敌方坦克车体，需要反装甲支援。各型装甲共用整备。"),TEXT("Captured Mark IV Female suppresses massed infantry with five machine guns and prepares sooner than cannon variants. It cannot damage tank hulls and needs anti-armour support. Armour types share readiness.")},
{TEXT("Captured Mark IV Female 以五挺机枪压制密集步兵，整备快于火炮型。无法损伤敌方坦克车体，需要反装甲支援。各型装甲共用整备。"),TEXT("Captured Mark IV Female suppresses massed infantry with five machine guns and prepares sooner than cannon variants. It cannot damage tank hulls and needs anti-armour support. Armour types share readiness."),TEXT("缴获雌型驶出修理棚，旧侧舱重新装好机枪。\n五处机枪位压制密集步兵，整备快于火炮型。无法对抗坦克车体，需要反装甲支援。各型装甲共用整备。")},
{TEXT("Captured Mark IV Female 以五挺机枪压制密集步兵，整备快于火炮型。无法损伤敌方坦克车体，需要反装甲支援。各型装甲共用整备。"),TEXT("Captured Mark IV Female suppresses massed infantry with five machine guns and prepares sooner than cannon variants. It cannot damage tank hulls and needs anti-armour support. Armour types share readiness."),TEXT("A captured female leaves the workshop with its guns refitted.\nFive machine-gun stations suppress infantry concentrations, with shorter preparation than cannon tanks. Cannot damage tank hulls and needs anti-armour support. All armour shares readiness.")},
{TEXT("Captured Mark IV Female 以五挺机枪压制密集步兵，整备快于火炮型。无法损伤敌方坦克车体，需要反装甲支援。各型装甲共用整备。"),TEXT("Captured Mark IV Female suppresses massed infantry with five machine guns and prepares sooner than cannon variants. It cannot damage tank hulls and needs anti-armour support. Armour types share readiness."),TEXT("缴获雌型驶出修理棚。机枪适合压制密集步兵，整备快于火炮型；遭遇坦克时需要反装甲火力。\n战术：5处机枪位；三种装甲共用整备。")},
{TEXT("Captured Mark IV Female 以五挺机枪压制密集步兵，整备快于火炮型。无法损伤敌方坦克车体，需要反装甲支援。各型装甲共用整备。"),TEXT("Captured Mark IV Female suppresses massed infantry with five machine guns and prepares sooner than cannon variants. It cannot damage tank hulls and needs anti-armour support. Armour types share readiness."),TEXT("A captured female leaves the repair shed. Its guns suppress concentrated infantry and prepare sooner than cannon tanks; enemy armour calls for anti-tank support.\nTactics: 5 machine-gun stations; all armour shares readiness.")},
{TEXT("炮长在电话那端复诵方位。\n多轮野炮轰击指定区域。适合固定阵位和集结部队；传令延迟与散布使移动目标较难命中，也会杀伤友军。"),TEXT("The battery repeats the bearing over the wire.\nSeveral salvos cover the selected area. Effective against fixed positions and concentrations; delay and scatter hinder attacks on moving targets. Friendly troops can be killed.")},
{TEXT("炮长在电话那端复诵方位。\n多轮野炮轰击指定区域。适合固定阵位和集结部队；传令延迟与散布使移动目标较难命中，也会杀伤友军。"),TEXT("The battery repeats the bearing over the wire.\nSeveral salvos cover the selected area. Effective against fixed positions and concentrations; delay and scatter hinder attacks on moving targets. Friendly troops can be killed."),TEXT("电话那端，炮长复诵方位。野炮以多轮爆炸覆盖指定地段；传令延迟和散布使移动目标更难命中。\n落弹区内的友军同样受伤。")},
{TEXT("炮长在电话那端复诵方位。\n多轮野炮轰击指定区域。适合固定阵位和集结部队；传令延迟与散布使移动目标较难命中，也会杀伤友军。"),TEXT("The battery repeats the bearing over the wire.\nSeveral salvos cover the selected area. Effective against fixed positions and concentrations; delay and scatter hinder attacks on moving targets. Friendly troops can be killed."),TEXT("At the other end of the wire, the battery repeats the bearing. Several salvos cover the chosen ground; delay and scatter make moving targets harder to hit.\nFriendly troops in the impact area are also at risk.")},
{TEXT("烟弹在无人区接连破裂。\n两轮烟幕掩护推进或撤离，削弱双方观察与直射火力。炮弹仍能穿过烟幕。"),TEXT("Smoke shells burst across no man's land.\nTwo groups screen an advance or withdrawal, reducing both armies' observation and direct fire. Shells still pass through the smoke.")},
{TEXT("烟弹在无人区接连破裂。\n两轮烟幕掩护推进或撤离，削弱双方观察与直射火力。炮弹仍能穿过烟幕。"),TEXT("Smoke shells burst across no man's land.\nTwo groups screen an advance or withdrawal, reducing both armies' observation and direct fire. Shells still pass through the smoke."),TEXT("烟弹在无人区拉起屏障。烟幕掩护过壕和撤离，也削弱双方观察与直射火力；炮弹仍可穿过。\n投烟：2轮。")},
{TEXT("烟弹在无人区接连破裂。\n两轮烟幕掩护推进或撤离，削弱双方观察与直射火力。炮弹仍能穿过烟幕。"),TEXT("Smoke shells burst across no man's land.\nTwo groups screen an advance or withdrawal, reducing both armies' observation and direct fire. Shells still pass through the smoke."),TEXT("Smoke shells raise a screen across no man's land. Smoke covers crossings and withdrawals while obscuring both sides' observation and direct fire; shells still pass through.\nDelivery: 2 groups.")},
{TEXT("携弹队把壕炮弹送到炮旁。\n四组迫击炮弹打击固定枪位与拥挤壕道。响应较慢，适合预判敌军集结；落弹也会杀伤友军。"),TEXT("The carrying party brings bombs to the trench mortar.\nFour groups strike fixed guns and crowded trenches. Slow response rewards anticipating enemy concentrations. Friendly troops in the barrage are also at risk.")},
{TEXT("携弹队把壕炮弹送到炮旁。\n四组迫击炮弹打击固定枪位与拥挤壕道。响应较慢，适合预判敌军集结；落弹也会杀伤友军。"),TEXT("The carrying party brings bombs to the trench mortar.\nFour groups strike fixed guns and crowded trenches. Slow response rewards anticipating enemy concentrations. Friendly troops in the barrage are also at risk."),TEXT("壕炮的炸弹越过胸墙。迫击炮打击固定枪位与拥挤壕道；响应较慢，友军须等最后一轮落弹后跟进。\n落弹：4组。")},
{TEXT("携弹队把壕炮弹送到炮旁。\n四组迫击炮弹打击固定枪位与拥挤壕道。响应较慢，适合预判敌军集结；落弹也会杀伤友军。"),TEXT("The carrying party brings bombs to the trench mortar.\nFour groups strike fixed guns and crowded trenches. Slow response rewards anticipating enemy concentrations. Friendly troops in the barrage are also at risk."),TEXT("Mortar bombs pass over the parapet. Mortars strike fixed guns and crowded trenches; their slow response calls for anticipation, with friendly troops following the final impacts.\nDelivery: 4 groups.")},
{TEXT("气弹破裂，警铃沿壕传开。\n毒云随风漂移，遮蔽视线并杀伤滞留步兵，也会威胁友军。完成佩戴的呼吸器大幅减缓毒气累积。"),TEXT("Gas shells burst. An alarm passes down the trench.\nDrifting clouds obscure sight and kill infantry that remain exposed, including friendly troops. A sealed respirator greatly slows gas exposure.")},
{TEXT("气弹破裂，警铃沿壕传开。\n毒云随风漂移，遮蔽视线并杀伤滞留步兵，也会威胁友军。完成佩戴的呼吸器大幅减缓毒气累积。"),TEXT("Gas shells burst. An alarm passes down the trench.\nDrifting clouds obscure sight and kill infantry that remain exposed, including friendly troops. A sealed respirator greatly slows gas exposure."),TEXT("气弹破裂，警铃沿壕传开。毒云随风漂移，遮蔽观察并威胁久留的步兵；风也会把毒气带向友军。\n戴好呼吸器可大幅减少毒气累积。")},
{TEXT("气弹破裂，警铃沿壕传开。\n毒云随风漂移，遮蔽视线并杀伤滞留步兵，也会威胁友军。完成佩戴的呼吸器大幅减缓毒气累积。"),TEXT("Gas shells burst. An alarm passes down the trench.\nDrifting clouds obscure sight and kill infantry that remain exposed, including friendly troops. A sealed respirator greatly slows gas exposure."),TEXT("Gas shells burst and an alarm passes down the trench. Drifting clouds obscure sight and endanger men who remain; the wind can carry them towards friendly troops.\nA sealed respirator greatly reduces gas exposure.")},
{TEXT("炮口压低，等待敌车进入射界。\n较快响应的反装甲火力，最多发射 6 发。仅攻击指定区域内可见的装甲；烟幕、遮挡或目标驶离会中断交战。"),TEXT("The gun is laid low for the approaching tank.\nA quick anti-armour response with up to 6 rounds. Engages visible armour inside the selected sector. Smoke, cover or a target leaving the sector interrupts fire.")},
{TEXT("炮口压低，等待敌车进入射界。\n较快响应的反装甲火力，最多发射 6 发。仅攻击指定区域内可见的装甲；烟幕、遮挡或目标驶离会中断交战。"),TEXT("The gun is laid low for the approaching tank.\nA quick anti-armour response with up to 6 rounds. Engages visible armour inside the selected sector. Smoke, cover or a target leaving the sector interrupts fire."),TEXT("炮口压低，炮手等着敌车进入射界。反坦克野炮打击指定地域内可见装甲；烟幕、遮挡或驶离地域都会使射击停止。\n弹药：最多6发，响应较快。")},
{TEXT("炮口压低，等待敌车进入射界。\n较快响应的反装甲火力，最多发射 6 发。仅攻击指定区域内可见的装甲；烟幕、遮挡或目标驶离会中断交战。"),TEXT("The gun is laid low for the approaching tank.\nA quick anti-armour response with up to 6 rounds. Engages visible armour inside the selected sector. Smoke, cover or a target leaving the sector interrupts fire."),TEXT("The muzzle lowers as a tank enters the gun's field of fire. Anti-tank guns engage visible armour in the chosen sector; smoke, cover or leaving the sector stops the engagement.\nAmmunition: up to 6 rounds, with a quicker response.")},
{TEXT("双翼机压低机头，掠过前沿。\n两次扫射打击航线内的暴露步兵。胸墙可挡住部分枪弹，重装甲抵御机枪火力；航线内的友军同样危险。"),TEXT("A biplane dips its nose over the front.\nTwo strafing passes attack exposed infantry along the flight path. Parapets offer cover and heavy armour resists the bullets. Friendly troops in the lane are also at risk.")},
{TEXT("双翼机压低机头，掠过前沿。\n两次扫射打击航线内的暴露步兵。胸墙可挡住部分枪弹，重装甲抵御机枪火力；航线内的友军同样危险。"),TEXT("A biplane dips its nose over the front.\nTwo strafing passes attack exposed infantry along the flight path. Parapets offer cover and heavy armour resists the bullets. Friendly troops in the lane are also at risk."),TEXT("双翼机低掠前沿。窄幅扫射压制暴露步兵和纵队；胸墙能挡住部分火力，重装甲抵御机枪弹。\n航线：2次通场；航线内友军也会中弹。")},
{TEXT("双翼机压低机头，掠过前沿。\n两次扫射打击航线内的暴露步兵。胸墙可挡住部分枪弹，重装甲抵御机枪火力；航线内的友军同样危险。"),TEXT("A biplane dips its nose over the front.\nTwo strafing passes attack exposed infantry along the flight path. Parapets offer cover and heavy armour resists the bullets. Friendly troops in the lane are also at risk."),TEXT("A biplane sweeps low over the front. Narrow strafing runs suppress exposed infantry and columns; parapets offer cover and heavy armour resists the bullets.\nFlight: 2 passes; friendly troops in the lane are also exposed.")},
{TEXT("炮兵与步兵核对最后一次表针。\n六组弹幕向敌后逐段推进，每组 3 发。压制连续阵位；跟进过近的友军也会遭到炮击。"),TEXT("Gunners and infantry check their watches once more.\nSix groups of 3 shells move the barrage towards the enemy rear. Suppresses successive positions and endangers friendly troops following too closely.")},
{TEXT("炮兵与步兵核对最后一次表针。\n六组弹幕向敌后逐段推进，每组 3 发。压制连续阵位；跟进过近的友军也会遭到炮击。"),TEXT("Gunners and infantry check their watches once more.\nSix groups of 3 shells move the barrage towards the enemy rear. Suppresses successive positions and endangers friendly troops following too closely."),TEXT("步兵与炮兵对准表针。徐进弹幕逐段向敌后压制枪位；跟进过近会遭己方炮火。\n弹幕：6组，每组3发。")},
{TEXT("炮兵与步兵核对最后一次表针。\n六组弹幕向敌后逐段推进，每组 3 发。压制连续阵位；跟进过近的友军也会遭到炮击。"),TEXT("Gunners and infantry check their watches once more.\nSix groups of 3 shells move the barrage towards the enemy rear. Suppresses successive positions and endangers friendly troops following too closely."),TEXT("Infantry and gunners set their watches. A creeping barrage suppresses successive positions towards the enemy rear; troops following too closely meet their own shells.\nBarrage: 6 groups of 3 rounds.")},
{TEXT("引信装定，榴霰弹在步兵头顶裂开。\n两轮齐射，每轮 3 发；引信操练增至三轮。克制开阔地上的密集步兵，深壕与坚土提供保护。对坦克无效，也会杀伤友军。"),TEXT("Fuzes are set. Shrapnel bursts above the infantry.\nTwo salvos of 3 shells, increased to three salvos by fuze drill. Effective against crowded infantry in the open; deep trenches and earth give protection. Harms allies and cannot damage tanks.")},
{TEXT("引信装定，榴霰弹在步兵头顶裂开。\n两轮齐射，每轮 3 发；引信操练增至三轮。克制开阔地上的密集步兵，深壕与坚土提供保护。对坦克无效，也会杀伤友军。"),TEXT("Fuzes are set. Shrapnel bursts above the infantry.\nTwo salvos of 3 shells, increased to three salvos by fuze drill. Effective against crowded infantry in the open; deep trenches and earth give protection. Harms allies and cannot damage tanks."),TEXT("引信刻度装定，榴霰弹在空中裂开。密集行军的步兵首当其冲，深壕和坚土遮挡弹珠。\n齐射：2轮，每轮3发；引信操练增加到3轮。不能伤害坦克，友军必须避开。")},
{TEXT("引信装定，榴霰弹在步兵头顶裂开。\n两轮齐射，每轮 3 发；引信操练增至三轮。克制开阔地上的密集步兵，深壕与坚土提供保护。对坦克无效，也会杀伤友军。"),TEXT("Fuzes are set. Shrapnel bursts above the infantry.\nTwo salvos of 3 shells, increased to three salvos by fuze drill. Effective against crowded infantry in the open; deep trenches and earth give protection. Harms allies and cannot damage tanks."),TEXT("Fuzes are set and shells split overhead. Shrapnel punishes infantry crowded in the open; deep trenches and earth screen the balls.\nSalvo: two groups of three, rising to three groups with fuze drill. Cannot damage tanks. Keep friendlies clear.")},
{TEXT("炸弹沿既定航线逐枚离架。\n12 枚炸弹覆盖轰炸带，适合固定阵位与密集部队。航线确定后不再追踪目标，友军须离开整条轰炸带。"),TEXT("Bombs leave the racks along the committed run.\nTwelve bombs cover a strip of ground, threatening fixed positions and concentrations. The aircraft does not follow moving targets; friendly troops must clear the entire run.")},
{TEXT("炸弹沿既定航线逐枚离架。\n12 枚炸弹覆盖轰炸带，适合固定阵位与密集部队。航线确定后不再追踪目标，友军须离开整条轰炸带。"),TEXT("Bombs leave the racks along the committed run.\nTwelve bombs cover a strip of ground, threatening fixed positions and concentrations. The aircraft does not follow moving targets; friendly troops must clear the entire run."),TEXT("炸弹沿航线依次离架。轰炸覆盖指定地段，适合密集步兵和固定阵位；飞机按既定航线飞行，友军须离开整条轰炸带。\n弹药：12枚炸弹。")},
{TEXT("炸弹沿既定航线逐枚离架。\n12 枚炸弹覆盖轰炸带，适合固定阵位与密集部队。航线确定后不再追踪目标，友军须离开整条轰炸带。"),TEXT("Bombs leave the racks along the committed run.\nTwelve bombs cover a strip of ground, threatening fixed positions and concentrations. The aircraft does not follow moving targets; friendly troops must clear the entire run."),TEXT("Bombs leave the racks along the flight path. Bombing covers the chosen ground, threatening concentrations and fixed positions; the aircraft follows its committed run, which friendly troops must clear.\nAmmunition: 12 bombs.")},
{TEXT("新兵在靶场学习测距、瞄准与稳枪。\n步枪命中率提高 10%；距离、掩体与压制仍影响射击。"),TEXT("Recruits practise judging distance and keeping a steady aim.\nRifle hit chance increases by 10%. Range, cover and suppression still affect the shot.")},
{TEXT("新兵在靶场学习测距、瞄准与稳枪。\n步枪命中率提高 10%；距离、掩体与压制仍影响射击。"),TEXT("Recruits practise judging distance and keeping a steady aim.\nRifle hit chance increases by 10%. Range, cover and suppression still affect the shot."),TEXT("枪托贴稳，准星落在胸墙缺口。\n战术：步枪命中机会提高 10%。距离、掩体与压制照常影响瞄准。")},
{TEXT("新兵在靶场学习测距、瞄准与稳枪。\n步枪命中率提高 10%；距离、掩体与压制仍影响射击。"),TEXT("Recruits practise judging distance and keeping a steady aim.\nRifle hit chance increases by 10%. Range, cover and suppression still affect the shot."),TEXT("The stock settles and the sights find a gap in the parapet.\nTactics: Rifle hit chance increases by 10%. Range, cover and suppression still affect the shot.")},
{TEXT("反复练习桥夹、弹盘和弹带装填，缩短战斗中的停火时间。\n各类武器装填时间缩短 15%。"),TEXT("Drills with clips, drums and belts reduce pauses in combat.\nWeapon reload time is reduced by 15%.")},
