{TEXT("反复练习桥夹、弹盘和弹带装填，缩短战斗中的停火时间。\n各类武器装填时间缩短 15%。"),TEXT("Drills with clips, drums and belts reduce pauses in combat.\nWeapon reload time is reduced by 15%."),TEXT("Clips, drums and belts must seat even in the dark.\nWeapon reload time is reduced by 15%.")},
{TEXT("反复练习桥夹、弹盘和弹带装填，缩短战斗中的停火时间。\n各类武器装填时间缩短 15%。"),TEXT("Drills with clips, drums and belts reduce pauses in combat.\nWeapon reload time is reduced by 15%."),TEXT("桥夹入槽，弹盘扣紧。\n战术：各类武器装填时间缩短 15%。")},
