{TEXT("短点射压住枪口，下一班趁隙越壕。\n机枪造成的压制提高 18%。"),TEXT("Short bursts pin the guns while the next section crosses.\nMachine-gun suppression increases by 18%.")},
{TEXT("短点射压住枪口，下一班趁隙越壕。\n机枪造成的压制提高 18%。"),TEXT("Short bursts pin the guns while the next section crosses.\nMachine-gun suppression increases by 18%."),TEXT("短点射沿敌军枪位逐个移过。\n战术：机枪造成的压制提高 18%。")},
{TEXT("短点射压住枪口，下一班趁隙越壕。\n机枪造成的压制提高 18%。"),TEXT("Short bursts pin the guns while the next section crosses.\nMachine-gun suppression increases by 18%."),TEXT("Short bursts move from one enemy post to the next.\nTactics: Machine-gun suppression increases by 18%.")},
{TEXT("炮位备好弹药，电话线重新接通。\n野炮整备时间缩短 15%。呼叫后的落弹延迟不变。"),TEXT("Ammunition is laid out. The battery line is restored.\nArtillery preparation is 15% shorter. Delivery time after a call is unchanged.")},
{TEXT("炮位备好弹药，电话线重新接通。\n野炮整备时间缩短 15%。呼叫后的落弹延迟不变。"),TEXT("Ammunition is laid out. The battery line is restored.\nArtillery preparation is 15% shorter. Delivery time after a call is unchanged."),TEXT("电话线修通，炮位备好下一批弹药。\n战术：野炮整备时间缩短 15%；呼叫后仍需等待炮火抵达。")},
{TEXT("炮位备好弹药，电话线重新接通。\n野炮整备时间缩短 15%。呼叫后的落弹延迟不变。"),TEXT("Ammunition is laid out. The battery line is restored.\nArtillery preparation is 15% shorter. Delivery time after a call is unchanged."),TEXT("The line is repaired and the battery lays out fresh ammunition.\nTactics: Artillery preparation is 15% shorter. The battery still needs time to deliver its fire.")},
{TEXT("练习壕里留下了投弹手的脚印。\n手雷命中率提高 12%，落点散布不变。"),TEXT("Bombers wear a path through the practice trench.\nGrenade hit chance increases by 12%; impact scatter is unchanged.")},
{TEXT("练习壕里留下了投弹手的脚印。\n手雷命中率提高 12%，落点散布不变。"),TEXT("Bombers wear a path through the practice trench.\nGrenade hit chance increases by 12%; impact scatter is unchanged."),TEXT("投弹手在练习壕里反复试投。\n战术：手雷命中机会提高 12%，落点散布保持不变。")},
