{TEXT("补充兵与携弹队分路进入交通壕。\n所有步兵小队整备时间缩短 10%。"),TEXT("Drafts and ammunition parties take separate trench routes.\nAll infantry sections prepare 10% sooner.")},
{TEXT("补充兵与携弹队分路进入交通壕。\n所有步兵小队整备时间缩短 10%。"),TEXT("Drafts and ammunition parties take separate trench routes.\nAll infantry sections prepare 10% sooner."),TEXT("携弹队与补充兵沿交通壕分路前行。\n战术：全部步兵小队整备时间缩短 10%。")},
{TEXT("补充兵与携弹队分路进入交通壕。\n所有步兵小队整备时间缩短 10%。"),TEXT("Drafts and ammunition parties take separate trench routes.\nAll infantry sections prepare 10% sooner."),TEXT("Ammunition parties and replacement drafts take separate trench routes.\nTactics: All infantry sections prepare 10% sooner.")},
{TEXT("刘易斯守住胸墙，步枪班越过空地。\n正在射击的驻壕机枪附近，推进步兵承受的枪弹压制降低 35%。"),TEXT("The Lewis holds the parapet as the rifles cross.\nAdvancing infantry near a firing trench machine gun take 35% less bullet suppression.")},
{TEXT("刘易斯守住胸墙，步枪班越过空地。\n正在射击的驻壕机枪附近，推进步兵承受的枪弹压制降低 35%。"),TEXT("The Lewis holds the parapet as the rifles cross.\nAdvancing infantry near a firing trench machine gun take 35% less bullet suppression."),TEXT("刘易斯先开火，步枪班随后越壕。\n战术：正在射击的驻壕机枪附近，推进步兵受到的子弹压制降低 35%。")},
{TEXT("刘易斯守住胸墙，步枪班越过空地。\n正在射击的驻壕机枪附近，推进步兵承受的枪弹压制降低 35%。"),TEXT("The Lewis holds the parapet as the rifles cross.\nAdvancing infantry near a firing trench machine gun take 35% less bullet suppression."),TEXT("The Lewis opens fire before the rifles climb out.\nTactics: Advancing infantry near a firing trench machine gun take 35% less bullet suppression.")},
{TEXT("军士获委任后，以军官身份随队指挥。\n指挥命中加成由 25% 升至 50%，每 6 秒缓解友军压制，行进中仍可下令。\n驻壕步枪对移动目标的压制提高 40%。"),TEXT("The NCO receives a field commission.\nThe command accuracy bonus rises from 25% to 50%, with suppression relief every 6 seconds, including while moving.\nEntrenched rifles suppress moving targets 40% more strongly.")},
{TEXT("军士获委任后，以军官身份随队指挥。\n指挥命中加成由 25% 升至 50%，每 6 秒缓解友军压制，行进中仍可下令。\n驻壕步枪对移动目标的压制提高 40%。"),TEXT("The NCO receives a field commission.\nThe command accuracy bonus rises from 25% to 50%, with suppression relief every 6 seconds, including while moving.\nEntrenched rifles suppress moving targets 40% more strongly."),TEXT("军官走在前队之间，命令随队向前。\n士官升级为军官：指挥命中加成由 25% 升至 50%，每 6 秒重整友军，行进中仍可下令。\n驻壕步枪对移动目标的压制提高 40%。")},
{TEXT("军士获委任后，以军官身份随队指挥。\n指挥命中加成由 25% 升至 50%，每 6 秒缓解友军压制，行进中仍可下令。\n驻壕步枪对移动目标的压制提高 40%。"),TEXT("The NCO receives a field commission.\nThe command accuracy bonus rises from 25% to 50%, with suppression relief every 6 seconds, including while moving.\nEntrenched rifles suppress moving targets 40% more strongly."),TEXT("The officer carries his orders with the leading men.\nUpgrades the NCO to an officer: the command accuracy bonus rises from 25% to 50%, with a rally every 6 seconds, including while moving.\nEntrenched rifles suppress moving targets 40% more strongly.")},
{TEXT("军士获委任后，以军官身份随队指挥。\n指挥命中加成由 25% 升至 50%，每 6 秒缓解友军压制，行进中仍可下令。\n驻壕步枪对移动目标的压制提高 40%。"),TEXT("The NCO receives a field commission.\nThe command accuracy bonus rises from 25% to 50%, with suppression relief every 6 seconds, including while moving.\nEntrenched rifles suppress moving targets 40% more strongly."),TEXT("军官跟着前队传下新的口令。\n战术：士官升级为军官：附近友军命中收益由25%提高到50%，每六秒重整一次且可边走边下令。驻壕步枪对移动目标的压制另提高40%。")},
{TEXT("军士获委任后，以军官身份随队指挥。\n指挥命中加成由 25% 升至 50%，每 6 秒缓解友军压制，行进中仍可下令。\n驻壕步枪对移动目标的压制提高 40%。"),TEXT("The NCO receives a field commission.\nThe command accuracy bonus rises from 25% to 50%, with suppression relief every 6 seconds, including while moving.\nEntrenched rifles suppress moving targets 40% more strongly."),TEXT("The officer carries a fresh order behind the leading section.\nTactics: Upgrades the NCO to an officer: nearby accuracy rises from a 25% to a 50% bonus. Rally orders come every six seconds, including while advancing. Trench rifles also suppress moving targets 40% more strongly.")},
{TEXT("枪手沿胸墙逐段分配火力。\n机枪压制更大范围的邻近敌军，射程不变。"),TEXT("The gunner works his fire along the parapet.\nMachine-gun suppression reaches more troops near the target. Firing range is unchanged.")},
{TEXT("枪手沿胸墙逐段分配火力。\n机枪压制更大范围的邻近敌军，射程不变。"),TEXT("The gunner works his fire along the parapet.\nMachine-gun suppression reaches more troops near the target. Firing range is unchanged."),TEXT("机枪转向相邻的射孔。\n战术：扩大机枪的邻近压制范围，射程不变。")},
{TEXT("枪手沿胸墙逐段分配火力。\n机枪压制更大范围的邻近敌军，射程不变。"),TEXT("The gunner works his fire along the parapet.\nMachine-gun suppression reaches more troops near the target. Firing range is unchanged."),TEXT("The gun traverses towards the next firing slit.\nTactics: Machine-gun suppression spreads to a wider area around its target; firing range is unchanged.")},
{TEXT("泥土与护板遮住枪手，射孔只容得下枪口。\n驻壕机枪手遭枪弹命中的机会与承受的压制均降低 25%。"),TEXT("Earth and shields shelter the gunner behind a narrow slit.\nEntrenched machine gunners suffer 25% less bullet hit chance and suppression.")},
{TEXT("泥土与护板遮住枪手，射孔只容得下枪口。\n驻壕机枪手遭枪弹命中的机会与承受的压制均降低 25%。"),TEXT("Earth and shields shelter the gunner behind a narrow slit.\nEntrenched machine gunners suffer 25% less bullet hit chance and suppression."),TEXT("枪口周围重新垒起泥土。\n战术：驻壕机枪手遭枪弹命中的机会与承受的压制均降低 25%。")},
{TEXT("泥土与护板遮住枪手，射孔只容得下枪口。\n驻壕机枪手遭枪弹命中的机会与承受的压制均降低 25%。"),TEXT("Earth and shields shelter the gunner behind a narrow slit.\nEntrenched machine gunners suffer 25% less bullet hit chance and suppression."),TEXT("Fresh earth is packed around the muzzle.\nTactics: Entrenched machine gunners suffer 25% less bullet hit chance and suppression.")},
{TEXT("枪手倒下，携弹手接住枪托。\n存活同伴靠近后可接替阵亡机枪手，继续使用刘易斯与剩余弹药。"),TEXT("The gunner falls. A bearer takes the stock.\nA surviving crewman can reach the fallen gunner and take over the Lewis with its remaining ammunition.")},
{TEXT("枪手倒下，携弹手接住枪托。\n存活同伴靠近后可接替阵亡机枪手，继续使用刘易斯与剩余弹药。"),TEXT("The gunner falls. A bearer takes the stock.\nA surviving crewman can reach the fallen gunner and take over the Lewis with its remaining ammunition."),TEXT("枪手倒下，携弹手接过枪托。\n战术：存活同伴会靠近并接替阵亡枪手，继续使用刘易斯及剩余弹药。")},
{TEXT("枪手倒下，携弹手接住枪托。\n存活同伴靠近后可接替阵亡机枪手，继续使用刘易斯与剩余弹药。"),TEXT("The gunner falls. A bearer takes the stock.\nA surviving crewman can reach the fallen gunner and take over the Lewis with its remaining ammunition."),TEXT("The gunner falls and a bearer takes the stock.\nTactics: A surviving crewman can reach the fallen gunner, take over the Lewis and continue with its remaining ammunition.")},
{TEXT("步枪班出壕，最后一挺机枪继续射击。\n整壕冲锋时，有枪手的机枪组留下掩护。壕内只剩机枪组后，可再次下令前进。"),TEXT("The rifles leave the trench under the last gun's cover.\nA trench-wide advance leaves manned machine-gun crews behind. When only the guns remain, a further order sends them forward.")},
{TEXT("步枪班出壕，最后一挺机枪继续射击。\n整壕冲锋时，有枪手的机枪组留下掩护。壕内只剩机枪组后，可再次下令前进。"),TEXT("The rifles leave the trench under the last gun's cover.\nA trench-wide advance leaves manned machine-gun crews behind. When only the guns remain, a further order sends them forward."),TEXT("步枪班出壕，机枪留在胸墙后。\n战术：整壕冲锋会留下有枪手的机枪组掩护；壕内只剩机枪组时可继续前进。")},
{TEXT("步枪班出壕，最后一挺机枪继续射击。\n整壕冲锋时，有枪手的机枪组留下掩护。壕内只剩机枪组后，可再次下令前进。"),TEXT("The rifles leave the trench under the last gun's cover.\nA trench-wide advance leaves manned machine-gun crews behind. When only the guns remain, a further order sends them forward."),TEXT("The rifles climb out while the gun stays at the parapet.\nTactics: A trench-wide advance leaves manned machine-gun crews covering the infantry. When no other sections remain, the guns can move on.")},
{TEXT("战地委任书送到连部。\n军士晋升为军官：命中率加成由 25% 升至 50%，指挥范围扩大，缓解压制的间隔由 8 秒减至 6 秒。\n金星标记军官，银星标记受指挥分队。"),TEXT("A field commission reaches company headquarters.\nThe sergeant becomes an officer: the accuracy bonus rises from 25% to 50%, command range expands, and suppression is relieved every 6 seconds instead of 8.\nGold marks the officer; silver marks sections under his command.")},
{TEXT("战地委任书送到连部。\n军士晋升为军官：命中率加成由 25% 升至 50%，指挥范围扩大，缓解压制的间隔由 8 秒减至 6 秒。\n金星标记军官，银星标记受指挥分队。"),TEXT("A field commission reaches company headquarters.\nThe sergeant becomes an officer: the accuracy bonus rises from 25% to 50%, command range expands, and suppression is relieved every 6 seconds instead of 8.\nGold marks the officer; silver marks sections under his command."),TEXT("战地委任书送到连部。\n军士升级为军官：指挥命中加成由 25% 升至 50%，范围扩大，重整间隔由 8 秒减至 6 秒。\n金星标记指挥者，银星标记受指挥分队。")},
{TEXT("战地委任书送到连部。\n军士晋升为军官：命中率加成由 25% 升至 50%，指挥范围扩大，缓解压制的间隔由 8 秒减至 6 秒。\n金星标记军官，银星标记受指挥分队。"),TEXT("A field commission reaches company headquarters.\nThe sergeant becomes an officer: the accuracy bonus rises from 25% to 50%, command range expands, and suppression is relieved every 6 seconds instead of 8.\nGold marks the officer; silver marks sections under his command."),TEXT("A field commission reaches company headquarters.\nUpgrades the sergeant to an officer: command accuracy rises from a 25% to a 50% bonus, reach increases, and the rally interval falls from 8 to 6 seconds.\nGold marks the commander; silver marks sections under orders.")},
{TEXT("战地委任书送到连部。\n军士晋升为军官：命中率加成由 25% 升至 50%，指挥范围扩大，缓解压制的间隔由 8 秒减至 6 秒。\n金星标记军官，银星标记受指挥分队。"),TEXT("A field commission reaches company headquarters.\nThe sergeant becomes an officer: the accuracy bonus rises from 25% to 50%, command range expands, and suppression is relieved every 6 seconds instead of 8.\nGold marks the officer; silver marks sections under his command."),TEXT("委任书送到前沿，军士接下新职。\n战术：军士升级为军官：附近友军命中收益由25%提高到50%，指挥范围扩大，重整间隔从八秒减至六秒。金星表示指挥者，银星表示受益分队。")},
{TEXT("战地委任书送到连部。\n军士晋升为军官：命中率加成由 25% 升至 50%，指挥范围扩大，缓解压制的间隔由 8 秒减至 6 秒。\n金星标记军官，银星标记受指挥分队。"),TEXT("A field commission reaches company headquarters.\nThe sergeant becomes an officer: the accuracy bonus rises from 25% to 50%, command range expands, and suppression is relieved every 6 seconds instead of 8.\nGold marks the officer; silver marks sections under his command."),TEXT("A commission reaches the front and the sergeant takes his new post.\nTactics: Upgrades the sergeant to an officer: the nearby accuracy bonus rises from 25% to 50%, command reach increases, and rally orders come every six seconds instead of eight. Gold marks the commander; silver marks affected sections.")},
{TEXT("突击队沿烟幕遮住的低地接近。\n己方烟幕中的推进突击队承受的枪弹压制减半，并接近至更短距离开火。"),TEXT("Assault parties close through the smoke-covered low ground.\nAssault troops advancing inside friendly smoke take half the bullet suppression and close to a shorter firing distance.")},
{TEXT("突击队沿烟幕遮住的低地接近。\n己方烟幕中的推进突击队承受的枪弹压制减半，并接近至更短距离开火。"),TEXT("Assault parties close through the smoke-covered low ground.\nAssault troops advancing inside friendly smoke take half the bullet suppression and close to a shorter firing distance."),TEXT("突击手沿烟幕边缘接近壕口。\n战术：己方烟幕中推进的突击队承受的枪弹压制减半，并在更近处接敌。")},
{TEXT("突击队沿烟幕遮住的低地接近。\n己方烟幕中的推进突击队承受的枪弹压制减半，并接近至更短距离开火。"),TEXT("Assault parties close through the smoke-covered low ground.\nAssault troops advancing inside friendly smoke take half the bullet suppression and close to a shorter firing distance."),TEXT("Assault men follow the edge of the smoke towards the trench.\nTactics: Assault troops advancing inside friendly smoke take half the bullet suppression and close to a shorter contact distance.")},
{TEXT("观察员报出地标，传令兵送回修正。\n指挥组与一名存活同伴停稳 2 秒、看清目标后，野炮与迫击炮首轮提前 2.5 秒，散布缩小 30%。\n移动、遮挡、烟雾或失去同伴会中断校射。精确射手仍可报告可见目标。"),TEXT("A landmark is sighted and a correction sent back.\nWith a living escort and a clear view, a commander halted for 2 seconds brings the first artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds sooner, with 30% less scatter.\nMovement, cover, smoke or loss of the escort interrupts correction. Marksmen retain their target reports.")},
{TEXT("观察员报出地标，传令兵送回修正。\n指挥组与一名存活同伴停稳 2 秒、看清目标后，野炮与迫击炮首轮提前 2.5 秒，散布缩小 30%。\n移动、遮挡、烟雾或失去同伴会中断校射。精确射手仍可报告可见目标。"),TEXT("A landmark is sighted and a correction sent back.\nWith a living escort and a clear view, a commander halted for 2 seconds brings the first artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds sooner, with 30% less scatter.\nMovement, cover, smoke or loss of the escort interrupts correction. Marksmen retain their target reports."),TEXT("观察员指认地标，传令兵记下方位。\n战术：指挥组携一名存活伴随兵停稳两秒，并看清目标时，野炮与迫击炮首轮提早2.5秒、散布缩小30%。烟雾、遮挡、移动或失去伴随兵会中断校射。精确射手仍可报告可见目标。")},
{TEXT("观察员报出地标，传令兵送回修正。\n指挥组与一名存活同伴停稳 2 秒、看清目标后，野炮与迫击炮首轮提前 2.5 秒，散布缩小 30%。\n移动、遮挡、烟雾或失去同伴会中断校射。精确射手仍可报告可见目标。"),TEXT("A landmark is sighted and a correction sent back.\nWith a living escort and a clear view, a commander halted for 2 seconds brings the first artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds sooner, with 30% less scatter.\nMovement, cover, smoke or loss of the escort interrupts correction. Marksmen retain their target reports."),TEXT("An observer points out a landmark and a runner notes the bearing.\nTactics: A commander halted for two seconds with a living escort brings the first artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds earlier with 30% less scatter, provided he can see the target. Smoke, obstruction, movement or loss of the escort interrupts correction. Marksmen retain their early target reports.")},
{TEXT("新坐标记入炮兵测地表。\n迫击炮散布缩小。指挥组与一名存活同伴停稳 2 秒、看清目标后，野炮与迫击炮首轮另提前 2.5 秒，散布再缩小 30%。\n移动、遮挡、烟雾或失去同伴会中断校射。"),TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey.\nMortar scatter tightens. With a living escort and a clear view, a commander halted for 2 seconds brings the first artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds sooner, with a further 30% less scatter.\nMovement, cover, smoke or loss of the escort interrupts correction.")},
{TEXT("新坐标记入炮兵测地表。\n迫击炮散布缩小。指挥组与一名存活同伴停稳 2 秒、看清目标后，野炮与迫击炮首轮另提前 2.5 秒，散布再缩小 30%。\n移动、遮挡、烟雾或失去同伴会中断校射。"),TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey.\nMortar scatter tightens. With a living escort and a clear view, a commander halted for 2 seconds brings the first artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds sooner, with a further 30% less scatter.\nMovement, cover, smoke or loss of the escort interrupts correction."),TEXT("炮位测地表添上前沿的新坐标。\n战术：缩小迫击炮散布。指挥组携存活伴随兵停稳两秒并看清目标时，野炮与迫击炮首轮另提早2.5秒、散布缩小30%；烟雾、遮挡、移动或失去伴随兵会中断校射。")},
{TEXT("新坐标记入炮兵测地表。\n迫击炮散布缩小。指挥组与一名存活同伴停稳 2 秒、看清目标后，野炮与迫击炮首轮另提前 2.5 秒，散布再缩小 30%。\n移动、遮挡、烟雾或失去同伴会中断校射。"),TEXT("New coordinates enter the battery survey.\nMortar scatter tightens. With a living escort and a clear view, a commander halted for 2 seconds brings the first artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds sooner, with a further 30% less scatter.\nMovement, cover, smoke or loss of the escort interrupts correction."),TEXT("Fresh front-line coordinates are entered on the battery survey.\nTactics: Tightens mortar scatter. A commander halted for two seconds with a living escort brings the first artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds earlier with 30% less scatter if the target is visible. Smoke, obstruction, movement or loss of the escort interrupts correction.")},
{TEXT("向己方烟幕区域呼叫野炮时，追加一轮补射。友军须避开弹着区。"),TEXT("Artillery called into friendly smoke receives an extra group. Keep friendly troops clear of the impact area.")},
