{TEXT("向己方烟幕区域呼叫野炮时，追加一轮补射。友军须避开弹着区。"),TEXT("Artillery called into friendly smoke receives an extra group. Keep friendly troops clear of the impact area."),TEXT("The battery holds one salvo for the guns behind the smoke.\nArtillery called into friendly smoke gains a final follow-up salvo.")},
