{TEXT("向己方烟幕区域呼叫野炮时，追加一轮补射。友军须避开弹着区。"),TEXT("Artillery called into friendly smoke receives an extra group. Keep friendly troops clear of the impact area."),TEXT("The smoke's position is reported and the battery reserves another salvo.\nTactics: Artillery called into friendly smoke gains a final follow-up salvo.")},
