{TEXT("手雷命中率提高 12%，落点散布不变。"),TEXT("Grenade hit chance increases by 12%; impact scatter is unchanged.")},
{TEXT("手雷命中率提高 12%，落点散布不变。"),TEXT("Grenade hit chance increases by 12%; impact scatter is unchanged."),TEXT("投弹手学会辨认壕道中的暴露处。落点仍会偏离，但近处的爆炸更有机会击中守军。")},
{TEXT("前沿补给"),TEXT("Forward supply")},
{TEXT("前沿补给"),TEXT("Forward supply"),TEXT("交通壕里的补给队")},
{TEXT("所有步兵小队整备时间缩短 10%。"),TEXT("All infantry sections prepare 10% sooner.")},
{TEXT("所有步兵小队整备时间缩短 10%。"),TEXT("All infantry sections prepare 10% sooner."),TEXT("弹药、口粮与替补人员沿交通壕送来。后方分工理顺，新的小队便能更快完成整备。")},
{TEXT("交替掩护"),TEXT("Fire and movement")},
{TEXT("交替掩护"),TEXT("Fire and movement"),TEXT("你掩护，我前进")},
{TEXT("正在射击的驻壕机枪附近，推进步兵承受的枪弹压制降低 35%。"),TEXT("Advancing infantry near a firing trench machine gun take 35% less bullet suppression.")},
{TEXT("正在射击的驻壕机枪附近，推进步兵承受的枪弹压制降低 35%。"),TEXT("Advancing infantry near a firing trench machine gun take 35% less bullet suppression."),TEXT("壕内的刘易斯刚刚开火，附近步兵便抓住机会向前。持续掩护能减轻他们跨越空地时的压制。")},
{TEXT("火力分配"),TEXT("Fire distribution")},
{TEXT("火力分配"),TEXT("Fire distribution"),TEXT("扫过整段壕肩")},
{TEXT("机枪压制更大范围的邻近敌军，射程不变。"),TEXT("Machine-gun suppression reaches more troops near the target. Firing range is unchanged.")},
{TEXT("机枪压制更大范围的邻近敌军，射程不变。"),TEXT("Machine-gun suppression reaches more troops near the target. Firing range is unchanged."),TEXT("枪手学会沿敌阵分配火力。被压住的枪位之外，周围的守军也更难从壕肩探头。")},
{TEXT("枪组接替"),TEXT("Gunner succession")},
{TEXT("枪组接替"),TEXT("Gunner succession"),TEXT("别让枪口沉默")},
{TEXT("存活同伴靠近后可接替阵亡机枪手，继续使用刘易斯与剩余弹药。"),TEXT("A surviving crewman can reach the fallen gunner and take over the Lewis with its remaining ammunition.")},
{TEXT("存活同伴靠近后可接替阵亡机枪手，继续使用刘易斯与剩余弹药。"),TEXT("A surviving crewman can reach the fallen gunner and take over the Lewis with its remaining ammunition."),TEXT("弹药手也要会用刘易斯。枪手阵亡后，存活的同伴会靠近枪位，接下剩余弹药与任务。")},
{TEXT("战地委任"),TEXT("Field commission")},
{TEXT("战地委任"),TEXT("Field commission"),TEXT("一纸任命")},
{TEXT("军士升级为军官：指挥命中加成由 25% 升至 50%，范围扩大，重整间隔由 8 秒减至 6 秒。"),TEXT("Upgrades the sergeant to an officer: command accuracy rises from a 25% to a 50% bonus, reach increases, and the rally interval falls from 8 to 6 seconds.")},
{TEXT("军士升级为军官：指挥命中加成由 25% 升至 50%，范围扩大，重整间隔由 8 秒减至 6 秒。"),TEXT("Upgrades the sergeant to an officer: command accuracy rises from a 25% to a 50% bonus, reach increases, and the rally interval falls from 8 to 6 seconds."),TEXT("指挥组长获任军官，以 Webley 自卫，用口令稳住附近部队。学会前沿观察后，他也能为更远处的炮火指引方向。")},
{TEXT("前沿观察"),TEXT("Forward observation")},
{TEXT("前沿观察"),TEXT("Forward observation"),TEXT("炮位前方的眼睛")},
{TEXT("指挥组与一名存活同伴停稳 2 秒、看清目标后，野炮与迫击炮首轮提前 2.5 秒，散布缩小 30%。"),TEXT("With a living escort and a clear view, a commander halted for 2 seconds brings the first artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds sooner, with 30% less scatter.")},
{TEXT("指挥组与一名存活同伴停稳 2 秒、看清目标后，野炮与迫击炮首轮提前 2.5 秒，散布缩小 30%。"),TEXT("With a living escort and a clear view, a commander halted for 2 seconds brings the first artillery or mortar salvo 2.5 seconds sooner, with 30% less scatter."),TEXT("射手与指挥组长学会报告所见。目标处于清楚的视线内时，野炮和迫击炮能更早送来首轮火力。")},
{TEXT("烟幕后续射"),TEXT("Smoke follow-up")},
{TEXT("向己方烟幕区域呼叫野炮时，追加一轮补射。"),TEXT("Artillery called into friendly smoke gains a final follow-up salvo.")},
{TEXT("向己方烟幕区域呼叫野炮时，追加一轮补射。"),TEXT("Artillery called into friendly smoke gains a final follow-up salvo."),TEXT("己方烟幕标出需要继续压制的地段，野炮在末轮补射。炮手看不见冲进烟里的自己人，步兵仍须等待。")},
{TEXT("狙击学校"),TEXT("Sniper school")},
{TEXT("狙击学校"),TEXT("Sniper school"),TEXT("狙击学校的来信")},
{TEXT("精确射手换装镜瞄 SMLE，射程与精准度提高。"),TEXT("Marksmen receive scoped SMLEs with greater range and accuracy.")},
{TEXT("精确射手换装镜瞄 SMLE，射程与精准度提高。"),TEXT("Marksmen receive scoped SMLEs with greater range and accuracy."),TEXT("精确射手完成专门操练，领到镜瞄 SMLE。更远处的枪口也能被辨认，沉住气的一枪更有把握。")},
{TEXT("指挥目标"),TEXT("Command targets")},
{TEXT("指挥目标"),TEXT("Command targets"),TEXT("先找指挥的人")},
{TEXT("狙击手优先瞄准可见的敌军指挥者，其次为机枪手。"),TEXT("Snipers prioritise visible enemy leaders, then machine gunners.")},
{TEXT("狙击手优先瞄准可见的敌军指挥者，其次为机枪手。"),TEXT("Snipers prioritise visible enemy leaders, then machine gunners."),TEXT("狙击手留意发号施令的敌军，再寻找机枪手。打断对方的组织，往往比追逐最近的散兵更有用。")},
{TEXT("战地重整"),TEXT("Field rally")},
{TEXT("战地重整"),TEXT("Field rally"),TEXT("跟着口令向前")},
{TEXT("收到附近指挥组命令后，推进中的步兵短暂减少 30% 的枪弹压制。"),TEXT("After receiving a nearby command order, advancing infantry briefly receive 30% less suppression from gunfire.")},
{TEXT("收到附近指挥组命令后，推进中的步兵短暂减少 30% 的枪弹压制。"),TEXT("After receiving a nearby command order, advancing infantry briefly receive 30% less suppression from gunfire."),TEXT("近期收到附近指挥组命令的推进步兵，承受的枪弹压制短暂降低 30%。")},
{TEXT("收到附近指挥组命令后，推进中的步兵短暂减少 30% 的枪弹压制。"),TEXT("After receiving a nearby command order, advancing infantry briefly receive 30% less suppression from gunfire."),TEXT("Recently rallied advancing infantry briefly take 30% less bullet suppression.")},
{TEXT("收到附近指挥组命令后，推进中的步兵短暂减少 30% 的枪弹压制。"),TEXT("After receiving a nearby command order, advancing infantry briefly receive 30% less suppression from gunfire."),TEXT("军官刚下达命令，附近推进中的步兵便更能顶住枪火。抓住这段短暂的镇定，越过下一片空地。")},
