{TEXT("装甲列车沿支线提供火炮和机枪支援，活动范围受轨道限制。步兵须守住铁路通路；敌方反装甲火力可击毁车体。"),TEXT("The armoured train provides cannon and machine-gun support along the branch line, with movement limited by the tracks. Infantry must hold the railway approaches; enemy anti-armour fire can destroy its hull."),TEXT("An armoured train covers this branch line with cannon and machine guns. It is confined to the tracks. Infantry contest the cutting; anti-armour fire can destroy the hull.")},
{TEXT("装甲列车沿支线提供火炮和机枪支援，活动范围受轨道限制。步兵须守住铁路通路；敌方反装甲火力可击毁车体。"),TEXT("The armoured train provides cannon and machine-gun support along the branch line, with movement limited by the tracks. Infantry must hold the railway approaches; enemy anti-armour fire can destroy its hull."),TEXT("装甲列车只属于这条架空的铁路支线。炮车与机枪能掩护轨道旁的地段，断开的通路却会让钢铁失去机动；步兵仍必须争夺切口与观察位置。")},
