{TEXT("步兵保护列车侧翼，工兵清除通路上的障碍。烟幕可遮住敌方反坦克炮的观察。"),TEXT("Infantry protect the train’s flanks while pioneers clear the approaches. Smoke can obscure enemy anti-tank observation."),TEXT("Infantry cover the train's flanks while pioneers clear the approaches. Smoke can deny enemy anti-tank guns a view.")},
{TEXT("步兵保护列车侧翼，工兵清除通路上的障碍。烟幕可遮住敌方反坦克炮的观察。"),TEXT("Infantry protect the train’s flanks while pioneers clear the approaches. Smoke can obscure enemy anti-tank observation."),TEXT("守住铁路支点，让工兵先清理接近线，避免敌方反装甲炮获得从容射击的机会。")},
