{TEXT("用反装甲火力攻击列车，烟幕掩护铁路旁的空地。工兵清障，步兵随后接近铁路切口。"),TEXT("Engage the train with anti-armour fire and screen the open ground beside the tracks. Pioneers clear obstacles before infantry approach the cutting."),TEXT("Anti-armour fire engages the gun car while smoke screens the open ground. Pioneers and rifle sections advance on the cutting in turns.")},
