{TEXT("最后的通路"),TEXT("The last route")},
{TEXT("最后的通路"),TEXT("The last route"),TEXT("带着还能归队的人")},
{TEXT("西线仍在交火，居民与部队共用村外通路。本次禁止毒气与空中轰炸，地面部队须清除残存障碍。"),TEXT("Fighting continues on the Western Front. Civilians and troops share the outer roads. Gas and aerial bombing are prohibited; ground troops must clear the remaining obstacles.")},
{TEXT("西线仍在交火，居民与部队共用村外通路。本次禁止毒气与空中轰炸，地面部队须清除残存障碍。"),TEXT("Fighting continues on the Western Front. Civilians and troops share the outer roads. Gas and aerial bombing are prohibited; ground troops must clear the remaining obstacles."),TEXT("停战的消息还没有送到西线每一条战壕。村庄里仍有平民，通路里仍有障碍；本次不批准毒气和空中轰炸，新的配属要围绕地面掩护安排。")},
{TEXT("工兵开路，步枪与机枪交替掩护。守军仍可能在最后一道阵位反击。"),TEXT("Pioneers clear the way under alternating rifle and machine-gun cover. The defenders may still counterattack from their final position.")},
