{TEXT("精确射手优先攻击敌方机枪手。完成狙击学校训练后，可换装射程更远的镜瞄 SMLE。"),TEXT("Marksmen prioritise enemy machine gunners. Sniper-school training unlocks a scoped SMLE with longer range."),TEXT("Marksmen counter enemy machine gunners. Sniper-school training equips them with longer-ranged scoped SMLEs.")},
{TEXT("精确射手优先攻击敌方机枪手。完成狙击学校训练后，可换装射程更远的镜瞄 SMLE。"),TEXT("Marksmen prioritise enemy machine gunners. Sniper-school training unlocks a scoped SMLE with longer range."),TEXT("精确射手加入连队，专门留意敌人的机枪。军士提醒他：先看清，再扣扳机；镜瞄装备仍要经过作战室的专门操练。")},
{TEXT("掩体保护射手，烟幕会遮住双方视线。近距离威胁需要普通步兵处理。"),TEXT("Cover protects the marksman; smoke obscures both armies' view. Ordinary infantry must deal with close threats.")},
