{TEXT("两名工兵随雌型 Mark IV 进入前沿。\n解锁工兵伴随配置，占一个装甲位。工兵可清障、维修，阵亡后停止作业。\n整备最快，无反坦克炮；机枪点射恢复间隔延长 75%。"),TEXT("Two pioneers accompany a female Mark IV to the front.\nUnlocks the engineer configuration in one armour slot. The pioneers clear obstacles and make repairs while alive.\nThe shortest preparation, no anti-tank cannon and 75% longer machine-gun burst recovery.")},
{TEXT("两名工兵随雌型 Mark IV 进入前沿。\n解锁工兵伴随配置，占一个装甲位。工兵可清障、维修，阵亡后停止作业。\n整备最快，无反坦克炮；机枪点射恢复间隔延长 75%。"),TEXT("Two pioneers accompany a female Mark IV to the front.\nUnlocks the engineer configuration in one armour slot. The pioneers clear obstacles and make repairs while alive.\nThe shortest preparation, no anti-tank cannon and 75% longer machine-gun burst recovery."),TEXT("铁丝网与断裂履带，需要车外的人来处理。解锁雌型马克IV工兵配属：两名真实工兵随车赶来，能够清障、维修，也会阵亡。占一个装甲位；工程纵队整备最快，但没有反坦克炮，机枪点射后的恢复间隔延长75%。")},
{TEXT("两名工兵随雌型 Mark IV 进入前沿。\n解锁工兵伴随配置，占一个装甲位。工兵可清障、维修，阵亡后停止作业。\n整备最快，无反坦克炮；机枪点射恢复间隔延长 75%。"),TEXT("Two pioneers accompany a female Mark IV to the front.\nUnlocks the engineer configuration in one armour slot. The pioneers clear obstacles and make repairs while alive.\nThe shortest preparation, no anti-tank cannon and 75% longer machine-gun burst recovery."),TEXT("Wire and disabled tracks demand men outside the armour. Unlocks a female Mark IV with two dismounted pioneers. They can clear obstacles and repair modules, and can be killed. Uses one armour slot; its prepared engineering column has the shortest shared preparation, but no anti-tank cannon and 75% longer machine-gun burst recovery.")},
{TEXT("A7V 501 的早期配置以机枪取代前炮。\n解锁 1918 年行动中的八机枪型 Gretchen，无反坦克炮。同时仅一辆在役。"),TEXT("A7V 501's early configuration carried machine guns in place of the front cannon.\nUnlocks the eight-gun Gretchen for 1918 operations. No anti-tank cannon; only one may be active.")},
