{TEXT("A7V 501 的早期配置以机枪取代前炮。\n解锁 1918 年行动中的八机枪型 Gretchen，无反坦克炮。同时仅一辆在役。"),TEXT("A7V 501's early configuration carried machine guns in place of the front cannon.\nUnlocks the eight-gun Gretchen for 1918 operations. No anti-tank cannon; only one may be active."),TEXT("A7V 501 served briefly with machine guns in place of the forward cannon. Unlocks its original eight-gun configuration in the 1918 operations. Only one may be active. No anti-tank cannon.")},
