{TEXT("Mark V 改进了菱形战车的操纵机构。\n解锁 1918 年八月起的雄型配置。机动与防护强于 Mark IV，整备时间更长。"),TEXT("The Mark V improves the steering of the rhomboid tank.\nUnlocks the male configuration from August 1918. More mobile and better protected than the Mark IV, with longer preparation."),TEXT("马克V为菱形战车带来改进的操纵机构。1918年八月攻势起可配属雄型；更好的机动与防护，以更长整备换取。马克IV仍是较快抵达的选择。")},
{TEXT("Mark V 改进了菱形战车的操纵机构。\n解锁 1918 年八月起的雄型配置。机动与防护强于 Mark IV，整备时间更长。"),TEXT("The Mark V improves the steering of the rhomboid tank.\nUnlocks the male configuration from August 1918. More mobile and better protected than the Mark IV, with longer preparation."),TEXT("The Mark V brings improved steering to the rhomboid tank. Unlocks the male configuration for the August 1918 offensive. Better mobility and protection cost a longer preparation; it does not replace the cheaper Mark IV.")},
{TEXT("步兵帮助车组观察侧翼。\n9 米内有存活友军步兵时，坦克机枪命中率提高 10%，同类加成不叠加。"),TEXT("Infantry help tank crews watch their flanks.\nA surviving friendly infantryman within 9 metres raises tank machine-gun accuracy by 10%; bonuses do not stack.")},
{TEXT("步兵帮助车组观察侧翼。\n9 米内有存活友军步兵时，坦克机枪命中率提高 10%，同类加成不叠加。"),TEXT("Infantry help tank crews watch their flanks.\nA surviving friendly infantryman within 9 metres raises tank machine-gun accuracy by 10%; bonuses do not stack."),TEXT("步兵观察车体两侧的死角。\n九米内有存活友军步兵时，坦克机枪命中率提高 10%。同类加成不叠加。")},
{TEXT("步兵帮助车组观察侧翼。\n9 米内有存活友军步兵时，坦克机枪命中率提高 10%，同类加成不叠加。"),TEXT("Infantry help tank crews watch their flanks.\nA surviving friendly infantryman within 9 metres raises tank machine-gun accuracy by 10%; bonuses do not stack."),TEXT("Infantry watch the ground hidden beside the hull.\nLiving friendly infantry within nine metres give tank machine guns 10% more accuracy. The bonus does not stack.")},
{TEXT("步兵帮助车组观察侧翼。\n9 米内有存活友军步兵时，坦克机枪命中率提高 10%，同类加成不叠加。"),TEXT("Infantry help tank crews watch their flanks.\nA surviving friendly infantryman within 9 metres raises tank machine-gun accuracy by 10%; bonuses do not stack."),TEXT("步兵替驾驶员盯住看不见的地面。有友军步兵在九米内掩护时，坦克机枪命中提高10%；多支部队不会叠加。")},
{TEXT("步兵帮助车组观察侧翼。\n9 米内有存活友军步兵时，坦克机枪命中率提高 10%，同类加成不叠加。"),TEXT("Infantry help tank crews watch their flanks.\nA surviving friendly infantryman within 9 metres raises tank machine-gun accuracy by 10%; bonuses do not stack."),TEXT("Infantry watch the ground the driver cannot see. A tank's machine guns gain 10% accuracy while living friendly infantry are within nine metres. Multiple sections do not stack this benefit.")},
{TEXT("工兵可抢修车载机枪。\n每辆坦克可修复一处机枪至半数耐久，需连续作业 8 秒，且 11 米内没有敌军。无法维修车体。"),TEXT("Pioneers can repair vehicle machine guns.\nEach tank can restore one machine gun to half durability after 8 uninterrupted seconds, with no enemy within 11 metres. Hulls cannot be repaired.")},
{TEXT("工兵可抢修车载机枪。\n每辆坦克可修复一处机枪至半数耐久，需连续作业 8 秒，且 11 米内没有敌军。无法维修车体。"),TEXT("Pioneers can repair vehicle machine guns.\nEach tank can restore one machine gun to half durability after 8 uninterrupted seconds, with no enemy within 11 metres. Hulls cannot be repaired."),TEXT("工兵把备用枪机送到受损枪位。\n每辆坦克可修复一处机枪至半数耐久。需连续作业 8 秒，且十一米内无敌军。车体无法维修。")},
{TEXT("工兵可抢修车载机枪。\n每辆坦克可修复一处机枪至半数耐久，需连续作业 8 秒，且 11 米内没有敌军。无法维修车体。"),TEXT("Pioneers can repair vehicle machine guns.\nEach tank can restore one machine gun to half durability after 8 uninterrupted seconds, with no enemy within 11 metres. Hulls cannot be repaired."),TEXT("Pioneers bring a spare action to the disabled gun mount.\nOne machine gun per tank can be restored to half strength. Requires 8 uninterrupted seconds with no enemy within eleven metres. Hull damage cannot be repaired.")},
{TEXT("工兵可抢修车载机枪。\n每辆坦克可修复一处机枪至半数耐久，需连续作业 8 秒，且 11 米内没有敌军。无法维修车体。"),TEXT("Pioneers can repair vehicle machine guns.\nEach tank can restore one machine gun to half durability after 8 uninterrupted seconds, with no enemy within 11 metres. Hulls cannot be repaired."),TEXT("工兵可为每辆车抢修一个损坏机枪，恢复一半耐久。需在车旁连续作业八秒，且十一米内没有敌人；不能修复车体。")},
{TEXT("工兵可抢修车载机枪。\n每辆坦克可修复一处机枪至半数耐久，需连续作业 8 秒，且 11 米内没有敌军。无法维修车体。"),TEXT("Pioneers can repair vehicle machine guns.\nEach tank can restore one machine gun to half durability after 8 uninterrupted seconds, with no enemy within 11 metres. Hulls cannot be repaired."),TEXT("Pioneers can restore one disabled machine gun per vehicle to half strength. Requires eight uninterrupted seconds beside the tank, with no enemy within eleven metres. Hull damage cannot be repaired.")},
{TEXT("里卡多发动机与新传动机构改善了操纵。\n双侧炮打击坚固阵位与装甲。机动、防护强于 Mark IV，整备时间更长，侧翼仍需步兵掩护。"),TEXT("The Ricardo engine and new transmission improve steering.\nTwin sponson guns engage strongpoints and armour. It is more mobile and better protected than the Mark IV, but takes longer to prepare. Infantry must guard its flanks.")},
{TEXT("里卡多发动机与新传动机构改善了操纵。\n双侧炮打击坚固阵位与装甲。机动、防护强于 Mark IV，整备时间更长，侧翼仍需步兵掩护。"),TEXT("The Ricardo engine and new transmission improve steering.\nTwin sponson guns engage strongpoints and armour. It is more mobile and better protected than the Mark IV, but takes longer to prepare. Infantry must guard its flanks."),TEXT("The Ricardo engine and new transmission improve steering.\nTwin sponson guns engage strongpoints and armour. More mobile and better protected than the Mark IV, with longer preparation. Infantry must guard the flanks.")},
{TEXT("里卡多发动机与新传动机构改善了操纵。\n双侧炮打击坚固阵位与装甲。机动、防护强于 Mark IV，整备时间更长，侧翼仍需步兵掩护。"),TEXT("The Ricardo engine and new transmission improve steering.\nTwin sponson guns engage strongpoints and armour. It is more mobile and better protected than the Mark IV, but takes longer to prepare. Infantry must guard its flanks."),TEXT("里卡多发动机与新的传动机构减轻了驾驶员的负担。双侧炮攻打坚固阵位、迎击装甲；机动与防护强于 Mark IV，整备更久，仍需步兵守住侧翼。")},
{TEXT("里卡多发动机与新传动机构改善了操纵。\n双侧炮打击坚固阵位与装甲。机动、防护强于 Mark IV，整备时间更长，侧翼仍需步兵掩护。"),TEXT("The Ricardo engine and new transmission improve steering.\nTwin sponson guns engage strongpoints and armour. It is more mobile and better protected than the Mark IV, but takes longer to prepare. Infantry must guard its flanks."),TEXT("The Ricardo engine and epicyclic transmission ease the driver's burden. Twin sponson guns break strongpoints and fight armour. Faster and tougher than a Mark IV, but slower to prepare; infantry must still guard its flanks.")},
{TEXT("雌型坦克掩护两名皇家工兵前进。\n工兵清除铁丝与地雷、抢修履带，阵亡后停止作业。五挺机枪，无主炮；整备最快，机枪点射恢复间隔延长 75%。"),TEXT("A female tank covers two Royal Engineers on the approach.\nThey clear wire and mines and repair tracks while alive. The tank has five machine guns and no cannon. It prepares fastest, but its machine guns take 75% longer to recover between bursts.")},
{TEXT("雌型坦克掩护两名皇家工兵前进。\n工兵清除铁丝与地雷、抢修履带，阵亡后停止作业。五挺机枪，无主炮；整备最快，机枪点射恢复间隔延长 75%。"),TEXT("A female tank covers two Royal Engineers on the approach.\nThey clear wire and mines and repair tracks while alive. The tank has five machine guns and no cannon. It prepares fastest, but its machine guns take 75% longer to recover between bursts."),TEXT("A female tank covers two Royal Engineers on the approach.\nThey clear wire and mines and repair tracks while alive. Five machine guns, no cannon. The shortest preparation, with 75% longer machine-gun burst recovery.")},
{TEXT("雌型坦克掩护两名皇家工兵前进。\n工兵清除铁丝与地雷、抢修履带，阵亡后停止作业。五挺机枪，无主炮；整备最快，机枪点射恢复间隔延长 75%。"),TEXT("A female tank covers two Royal Engineers on the approach.\nThey clear wire and mines and repair tracks while alive. The tank has five machine guns and no cannon. It prepares fastest, but its machine guns take 75% longer to recover between bursts."),TEXT("雌型车掩护两名皇家工兵穿过空地。工兵剪开铁丝、清除地雷并抢修履带；一旦阵亡，清障与修理便随之停止。五挺机枪，无主炮；整备最快，机枪点射后的恢复间隔延长75%。")},
{TEXT("雌型坦克掩护两名皇家工兵前进。\n工兵清除铁丝与地雷、抢修履带，阵亡后停止作业。五挺机枪，无主炮；整备最快，机枪点射恢复间隔延长 75%。"),TEXT("A female tank covers two Royal Engineers on the approach.\nThey clear wire and mines and repair tracks while alive. The tank has five machine guns and no cannon. It prepares fastest, but its machine guns take 75% longer to recover between bursts."),TEXT("A female tank shelters two Royal Engineers on the approach. They clear wire and mines and repair broken tracks. Protect them: casualties end their work. Five machine guns, no cannon. The shortest armour preparation, traded for 75% longer machine-gun burst recovery.")},
{TEXT("A7V 501 的八机枪配置，前部双机枪取代主炮。\n密集火力克制步兵，无法损伤坦克车体。同时仅一辆在役。"),TEXT("A7V 501 in its eight-gun configuration, with twin front guns replacing the cannon.\nConcentrated fire counters infantry but cannot damage tank hulls. Only one may be active.")},
{TEXT("A7V 501 的八机枪配置，前部双机枪取代主炮。\n密集火力克制步兵，无法损伤坦克车体。同时仅一辆在役。"),TEXT("A7V 501 in its eight-gun configuration, with twin front guns replacing the cannon.\nConcentrated fire counters infantry but cannot damage tank hulls. Only one may be active."),TEXT("501 号 Gretchen 的罕见机枪配置。前部双机枪取代主炮，近处步兵承受密集扫射；遇到火炮坦克必须依靠反坦克火力。同一时间仅配属一辆。")},
{TEXT("A7V 501 的八机枪配置，前部双机枪取代主炮。\n密集火力克制步兵，无法损伤坦克车体。同时仅一辆在役。"),TEXT("A7V 501 in its eight-gun configuration, with twin front guns replacing the cannon.\nConcentrated fire counters infantry but cannot damage tank hulls. Only one may be active."),TEXT("The rare machine-gun configuration of A7V 501. Twin front guns replace the cannon for close infantry fighting. Cannot duel cannon tanks; only one Gretchen may be active at a time.")},
{TEXT("修复的缴获雌型掩护两名 Pioniere 前进。\n工兵清除铁丝与地雷、抢修履带，阵亡后停止作业。无主炮；整备最快，机枪点射恢复间隔延长 75%。"),TEXT("A repaired captured female tank covers two Pioniere.\nThey clear wire and mines and repair tracks while alive. The tank has no cannon. It prepares fastest, but its machine guns take 75% longer to recover between bursts.")},
{TEXT("修复的缴获雌型掩护两名 Pioniere 前进。\n工兵清除铁丝与地雷、抢修履带，阵亡后停止作业。无主炮；整备最快，机枪点射恢复间隔延长 75%。"),TEXT("A repaired captured female tank covers two Pioniere.\nThey clear wire and mines and repair tracks while alive. The tank has no cannon. It prepares fastest, but its machine guns take 75% longer to recover between bursts."),TEXT("A repaired captured female covers two Pioniere.\nThey clear wire and mines and repair tracks while alive. No cannon. The shortest preparation, with 75% longer machine-gun burst recovery.")},
{TEXT("修复的缴获雌型掩护两名 Pioniere 前进。\n工兵清除铁丝与地雷、抢修履带，阵亡后停止作业。无主炮；整备最快，机枪点射恢复间隔延长 75%。"),TEXT("A repaired captured female tank covers two Pioniere.\nThey clear wire and mines and repair tracks while alive. The tank has no cannon. It prepares fastest, but its machine guns take 75% longer to recover between bursts."),TEXT("修复的缴获雌型掩护两名工兵前进。工兵打开铁丝与雷区通路，并能抢修履带；保存他们，通路才能保持畅通。没有主炮；工程纵队整备最快，机枪点射后的恢复间隔延长75%。")},
{TEXT("修复的缴获雌型掩护两名 Pioniere 前进。\n工兵清除铁丝与地雷、抢修履带，阵亡后停止作业。无主炮；整备最快，机枪点射恢复间隔延长 75%。"),TEXT("A repaired captured female tank covers two Pioniere.\nThey clear wire and mines and repair tracks while alive. The tank has no cannon. It prepares fastest, but its machine guns take 75% longer to recover between bursts."),TEXT("A repaired female tank shelters two Pioniere. They open wire and mine lanes and can restore a broken track. Keep them alive to keep the advance moving. No cannon. This ready engineering column has the shortest armour preparation, but 75% longer machine-gun burst recovery.")},
{TEXT("里卡多发动机与新传动机构改善了操纵。\n双侧炮打击坚固阵位与装甲。机动、防护强于 Mark IV，整备时间更长，侧翼仍需步兵掩护。"),TEXT("The Ricardo engine and new transmission improve steering.\nTwin sponson guns engage strongpoints and armour. It is more mobile and better protected than the Mark IV, but takes longer to prepare. Infantry must guard its flanks."),TEXT("新的传动机构让驾驶员独自操纵车身。双侧炮适合突破坚固阵位，整备更久；近侧仍需步兵守护。")},
{TEXT("雌型坦克掩护两名皇家工兵前进。\n工兵清除铁丝与地雷、抢修履带，阵亡后停止作业。五挺机枪，无主炮；整备最快，机枪点射恢复间隔延长 75%。"),TEXT("A female tank covers two Royal Engineers on the approach.\nThey clear wire and mines and repair tracks while alive. The tank has five machine guns and no cannon. It prepares fastest, but its machine guns take 75% longer to recover between bursts."),TEXT("雌型车掩护两名随车工兵清除铁丝、地雷并抢修履带。工兵会阵亡；已编成的工程纵队整备最快，但工程补给挤占弹药，机枪连射后的补给间隔更长。")},
{TEXT("A7V 501 的八机枪配置，前部双机枪取代主炮。\n密集火力克制步兵，无法损伤坦克车体。同时仅一辆在役。"),TEXT("A7V 501 in its eight-gun configuration, with twin front guns replacing the cannon.\nConcentrated fire counters infantry but cannot damage tank hulls. Only one may be active."),TEXT("前部双机枪取代火炮的罕见雌型配置。近距多枪位反步兵，无反坦克火炮；同一时间仅配属一辆。")},
{TEXT("修复的缴获雌型掩护两名 Pioniere 前进。\n工兵清除铁丝与地雷、抢修履带，阵亡后停止作业。无主炮；整备最快，机枪点射恢复间隔延长 75%。"),TEXT("A repaired captured female tank covers two Pioniere.\nThey clear wire and mines and repair tracks while alive. The tank has no cannon. It prepares fastest, but its machine guns take 75% longer to recover between bursts."),TEXT("缴获雌型掩护两名工兵打开障碍带、抢修履带。车身没有反坦克炮，整备快于战斗坦克，工程补给使机枪点射间隔更长；工兵仍会阵亡。")},
{TEXT("十一月十一日上午十一时，西线停火。消息沿电话线传到连部，前沿的枪声逐渐停下。士兵走出战壕，担架队仍在运送伤员。"),TEXT("At eleven on 11 November, the Western Front ceases fire. The news reaches company headquarters by telephone and the front-line guns fall silent. Soldiers leave the trenches while stretcher parties still carry the wounded.")},
{TEXT("十一月十一日上午十一时，西线停火。消息沿电话线传到连部，前沿的枪声逐渐停下。士兵走出战壕，担架队仍在运送伤员。"),TEXT("At eleven on 11 November, the Western Front ceases fire. The news reaches company headquarters by telephone and the front-line guns fall silent. Soldiers leave the trenches while stretcher parties still carry the wounded."),TEXT("十一月十一日上午十一时，西线停火。消息沿电话线传到连部，前沿的枪声逐渐止息。士兵爬上壕沿，身后的担架队还在行走。")},
{TEXT("十一月十一日上午十一时，西线停火。消息沿电话线传到连部，前沿的枪声逐渐停下。士兵走出战壕，担架队仍在运送伤员。"),TEXT("At eleven on 11 November, the Western Front ceases fire. The news reaches company headquarters by telephone and the front-line guns fall silent. Soldiers leave the trenches while stretcher parties still carry the wounded."),TEXT("At eleven on 11 November, the Western Front ceasefire takes effect. The news reaches the company by telephone. Men climb onto the parapet as stretcher parties continue behind them.")},
{TEXT("十一月十一日上午十一时，西线停火。消息沿电话线传到连部，前沿的枪声逐渐停下。士兵走出战壕，担架队仍在运送伤员。"),TEXT("At eleven on 11 November, the Western Front ceases fire. The news reaches company headquarters by telephone and the front-line guns fall silent. Soldiers leave the trenches while stretcher parties still carry the wounded."),TEXT("十一月十一日上午十一时，西线停火。电话把消息传到连部，前沿的枪声逐渐停下。有人欢呼，有人坐在壕边，把步枪靠在身旁。")},
{TEXT("十一月十一日上午十一时，西线停火。消息沿电话线传到连部，前沿的枪声逐渐停下。士兵走出战壕，担架队仍在运送伤员。"),TEXT("At eleven on 11 November, the Western Front ceases fire. The news reaches company headquarters by telephone and the front-line guns fall silent. Soldiers leave the trenches while stretcher parties still carry the wounded."),TEXT("At eleven on 11 November, the Western Front ceasefire takes effect. The news reaches company headquarters by telephone and the forward guns fall silent. Some men cheer; others sit on the trench edge with rifles beside them.")},
{TEXT("连队清点生还者，将尚未归队的人记入名册。桑布尔的战斗结束了，归乡命令还没有送到。"),TEXT("The company counts its survivors and records those who have not returned. The fighting at the Sambre is over; orders to go home have not arrived.")},
{TEXT("连队清点生还者，将尚未归队的人记入名册。桑布尔的战斗结束了，归乡命令还没有送到。"),TEXT("The company counts its survivors and records those who have not returned. The fighting at the Sambre is over; orders to go home have not arrived."),TEXT("连队清点生还者，把未归队者记入名册。桑布尔之后的行军结束了，归乡命令尚未送到。")},
{TEXT("连队清点生还者，将尚未归队的人记入名册。桑布尔的战斗结束了，归乡命令还没有送到。"),TEXT("The company counts its survivors and records those who have not returned. The fighting at the Sambre is over; orders to go home have not arrived."),TEXT("The company musters its survivors and records the missing. The march beyond the Sambre is over. Orders for home have yet to arrive.")},
{TEXT("连队清点生还者，将尚未归队的人记入名册。桑布尔的战斗结束了，归乡命令还没有送到。"),TEXT("The company counts its survivors and records those who have not returned. The fighting at the Sambre is over; orders to go home have not arrived."),TEXT("连队清点生还者，登记仍未归队的人。桑布尔之后的行军结束了，回家的日期还没有送到。")},
{TEXT("连队清点生还者，将尚未归队的人记入名册。桑布尔的战斗结束了，归乡命令还没有送到。"),TEXT("The company counts its survivors and records those who have not returned. The fighting at the Sambre is over; orders to go home have not arrived."),TEXT("The company musters its survivors and records those still missing. The march beyond the Sambre is over. No date for the journey home has arrived.")},
