{TEXT("十一月十一日上午十一时，停战生效。枪炮沉寂，德军开始准备撤出占领区。连队在撤退道路旁重新集合。"),TEXT("At eleven on 11 November, the armistice takes effect. The guns fall silent as German troops prepare to leave the occupied territories. The company assembles beside the withdrawal road."),TEXT("At eleven on 11 November, the armistice takes effect. The front stops firing as German troops prepare to leave the occupied territories. The company assembles along the withdrawal road.")},
