{TEXT("亚眠前沿接连失去联络。Captured Mark IV 与 Tankgewehr 枪组赶来增援，机枪掩护后卫。打通道路，让撤出的部队通过。"),TEXT("Posts at Amiens fall out of contact. Captured Mark IVs and Tankgewehr teams arrive while machine guns cover the rear guard. Reopen the road for withdrawing troops."),TEXT("中央壕是后撤的通路。机枪分散设置，风暴队作为近壕反击预备队；辨认英军狙击手和观察员，别把所有弹鼓消耗在远处的人影上。")},
{TEXT("亚眠清晨，澳大利亚与加拿大部队在雾中向东推进，英军位于左侧，法军在南侧作战。炮兵、坦克和航空观察员配合步兵行动；德军前沿正设法恢复联络。"),TEXT("At dawn at Amiens, Australian and Canadian troops advance east through mist, with British troops on the left and French troops to the south. Artillery, tanks and aerial observers support the infantry while German posts try to restore contact.")},
{TEXT("亚眠清晨，澳大利亚与加拿大部队在雾中向东推进，英军位于左侧，法军在南侧作战。炮兵、坦克和航空观察员配合步兵行动；德军前沿正设法恢复联络。"),TEXT("At dawn at Amiens, Australian and Canadian troops advance east through mist, with British troops on the left and French troops to the south. Artillery, tanks and aerial observers support the infantry while German posts try to restore contact."),TEXT("亚眠清晨的雾里，澳大利亚与加拿大部队向东展开，英军在左侧、法军在南侧行动。炮兵、坦克和航空观察按同一张时刻表工作，德军前沿正设法接回失联枪位。")},
{TEXT("亚眠清晨，澳大利亚与加拿大部队在雾中向东推进，英军位于左侧，法军在南侧作战。炮兵、坦克和航空观察员配合步兵行动；德军前沿正设法恢复联络。"),TEXT("At dawn at Amiens, Australian and Canadian troops advance east through mist, with British troops on the left and French troops to the south. Artillery, tanks and aerial observers support the infantry while German posts try to restore contact."),TEXT("In the morning mist at Amiens, Australian and Canadian troops move east, with British forces on the left and French forces to the south. Guns, tanks and aerial observation follow one timetable as German posts try to restore contact.")},
{TEXT("亚眠清晨，澳大利亚与加拿大部队在雾中向东推进，英军位于左侧，法军在南侧作战。炮兵、坦克和航空观察员配合步兵行动；德军前沿正设法恢复联络。"),TEXT("At dawn at Amiens, Australian and Canadian troops advance east through mist, with British troops on the left and French troops to the south. Artillery, tanks and aerial observers support the infantry while German posts try to restore contact."),TEXT("协约军的突然进攻压向亚眠东部。前沿在雾中失去联络，局部守军必须拖住进攻，为后方重新组织争取时间；守住一段交通壕已经足以改变这支连队的命运。")},
