{TEXT("康布雷前线的冬季巡逻、抓俘和修壕仍在继续。雨雪中出现新脚印，前哨正查探敌军换防情况。"),TEXT("Winter patrols, prisoner raids and trench repairs continue at Cambrai. Fresh tracks appear in the sleet as outposts investigate enemy reliefs."),TEXT("大攻势之间，巡逻、抓俘与修壕没有停止。本关是康布雷战区冬季活动的连级合成情景，不代表一场虚构的正式大会战。")},
{TEXT("康布雷前线的冬季巡逻、抓俘和修壕仍在继续。雨雪中出现新脚印，前哨正查探敌军换防情况。"),TEXT("Winter patrols, prisoner raids and trench repairs continue at Cambrai. Fresh tracks appear in the sleet as outposts investigate enemy reliefs."),TEXT("冬季的康布雷前线仍在巡逻、抓俘和修壕。雨雪留下新的脚印，前哨等待对面的接防消息。")},
{TEXT("康布雷前线的冬季巡逻、抓俘和修壕仍在继续。雨雪中出现新脚印，前哨正查探敌军换防情况。"),TEXT("Winter patrols, prisoner raids and trench repairs continue at Cambrai. Fresh tracks appear in the sleet as outposts investigate enemy reliefs."),TEXT("Winter patrols, prisoner raids and trench repairs continue on the Cambrai front. Sleet leaves fresh tracks as outposts await word of the enemy relief.")},
{TEXT("康布雷前线的冬季巡逻、抓俘和修壕仍在继续。雨雪中出现新脚印，前哨正查探敌军换防情况。"),TEXT("Winter patrols, prisoner raids and trench repairs continue at Cambrai. Fresh tracks appear in the sleet as outposts investigate enemy reliefs."),TEXT("Between offensives, patrols, prisoner raids and trench repairs continue. This company action is an authored composite of winter activity in the Cambrai sector, not an invented named battle.")},
{TEXT("追击抵达塞勒河谷，铁路切口成为后卫据点。本连须打通路堤旁的道路，为后续部队开路。"),TEXT("The pursuit reaches the Selle valley, where a railway cutting forms a rearguard post. The company must clear the roads beside the embankment for the following troops."),TEXT("塞勒河战役把追击带进河谷与铁路切口。本关的装甲列车是以战时铁路火力为基础的合成局部情景，并非声称某列具名车辆在此参战。")},
{TEXT("追击抵达塞勒河谷，铁路切口成为后卫据点。本连须打通路堤旁的道路，为后续部队开路。"),TEXT("The pursuit reaches the Selle valley, where a railway cutting forms a rearguard post. The company must clear the roads beside the embankment for the following troops."),TEXT("追击抵达塞勒河谷，铁路切口成为后卫据点。本连须打通路堤旁的接近线，为后续部队开路。")},
{TEXT("追击抵达塞勒河谷，铁路切口成为后卫据点。本连须打通路堤旁的道路，为后续部队开路。"),TEXT("The pursuit reaches the Selle valley, where a railway cutting forms a rearguard post. The company must clear the roads beside the embankment for the following troops."),TEXT("The pursuit reaches the Selle valley, where a railway cutting forms a rearguard post. The company must open the embankment approaches for the following troops.")},
{TEXT("追击抵达塞勒河谷，铁路切口成为后卫据点。本连须打通路堤旁的道路，为后续部队开路。"),TEXT("The pursuit reaches the Selle valley, where a railway cutting forms a rearguard post. The company must clear the roads beside the embankment for the following troops."),TEXT("The Selle fighting brings the pursuit into river valleys and railway cuttings. The armoured train is an authored local scenario based on wartime railway firepower, not a claim for a named train at this battle.")},
{TEXT("梅西讷进攻前，第二集团军核对测绘资料、爆破点和炮兵射击表。邻段澳新部队送来草图，补全接合部坐标。"),TEXT("Before Messines, Second Army checks surveys, mine positions and artillery tables. Sketches from neighbouring ANZAC troops complete the junction coordinates."),TEXT("梅西讷攻势前，第二集团军把测绘、地下爆破与炮兵表反复核对。澳新邻段送来接合处的草图；图纸不会替步兵占壕，却让第一批炮弹少走一段传令路。")},
{TEXT("梅西讷进攻前，第二集团军核对测绘资料、爆破点和炮兵射击表。邻段澳新部队送来草图，补全接合部坐标。"),TEXT("Before Messines, Second Army checks surveys, mine positions and artillery tables. Sketches from neighbouring ANZAC troops complete the junction coordinates."),TEXT("梅西讷攻击前，第二集团军复核测绘、爆破点与炮兵表。澳新邻段送来的草图补全了接合部坐标。")},
{TEXT("梅西讷进攻前，第二集团军核对测绘资料、爆破点和炮兵射击表。邻段澳新部队送来草图，补全接合部坐标。"),TEXT("Before Messines, Second Army checks surveys, mine positions and artillery tables. Sketches from neighbouring ANZAC troops complete the junction coordinates."),TEXT("Before Messines, Second Army checks its surveys, mine positions and fire tables. Sketches from the neighbouring ANZAC sector complete the junction coordinates.")},
{TEXT("梅西讷进攻前，第二集团军核对测绘资料、爆破点和炮兵射击表。邻段澳新部队送来草图，补全接合部坐标。"),TEXT("Before Messines, Second Army checks surveys, mine positions and artillery tables. Sketches from neighbouring ANZAC troops complete the junction coordinates."),TEXT("Before Messines, Second Army checks its surveys, mine plans and artillery tables together. An Australian and New Zealand liaison party sends sketches of the junction. The paper will not take a trench, but it shortens the route to the guns.")},
{TEXT("炮车陷进泥地，壕炮弹改由携弹队背送。重炮仍在后方等待通路，前沿先用已经抵达的弹药。"),TEXT("Gun wagons sink into the mud. Bearers shoulder mortar bombs while heavy batteries wait for a route forward. The front uses the ammunition already through."),TEXT("炮车陷在泥里，携弹手把壕炮弹分装到肩上。后方仍有炮，却不是每一种炮都能按时接上前沿；这两次行动必须先依靠搬得过去的火力。")},
{TEXT("炮车陷进泥地，壕炮弹改由携弹队背送。重炮仍在后方等待通路，前沿先用已经抵达的弹药。"),TEXT("Gun wagons sink into the mud. Bearers shoulder mortar bombs while heavy batteries wait for a route forward. The front uses the ammunition already through."),TEXT("The wagons sink in the mud. Bearers divide the mortar rounds between their shoulders. Guns remain in the rear, but not every battery can reach the front on time. For the next two operations, portable firepower comes first.")},
{TEXT("东线部队陆续运到西线。突击操练与弹药分配令送到连部，携弹队准备跟随攻势前移。"),TEXT("Troops from the Eastern Front arrive in the west. Assault drills and ammunition orders reach the companies as carrying parties prepare to follow the advance."),TEXT("俄国退出战争后，德国把更多兵力转向西线。连队收到的不是一场已经赢下的战争，而是突击操练、弹药与出发时刻；纵深越大，补给线也会越长。")},
{TEXT("东线部队陆续运到西线。突击操练与弹药分配令送到连部，携弹队准备跟随攻势前移。"),TEXT("Troops from the Eastern Front arrive in the west. Assault drills and ammunition orders reach the companies as carrying parties prepare to follow the advance."),TEXT("After Russia leaves the war, Germany transfers more troops west. The company receives no victory in advance: it receives assault drills, ammunition and a departure time. Every mile gained will lengthen the supply route.")},
{TEXT("运河坡岸被炮火破坏，残存纤道仍可通行。烟弹和炮兵联络优先配给渡口，这项安排延续至塞勒河行动。"),TEXT("Shellfire has damaged the canal banks, but the remaining towpath is still open. Smoke ammunition and artillery liaison receive priority at the crossings, continuing into the Selle operation."),TEXT("明渠两侧土坡已被炮火打坏，交通却必须沿着残存纤道继续。后方把烟弹和少量炮兵联络先送到尚能通行的渡口；这份优先令将跟随后卫一直到塞勒河。")},
{TEXT("运河坡岸被炮火破坏，残存纤道仍可通行。烟弹和炮兵联络优先配给渡口，这项安排延续至塞勒河行动。"),TEXT("Shellfire has damaged the canal banks, but the remaining towpath is still open. Smoke ammunition and artillery liaison receive priority at the crossings, continuing into the Selle operation."),TEXT("明渠坡岸被炮火打坏，残存纤道仍承担交通。烟弹与炮兵联络优先配给渡口，后续塞勒河行动继续按此供给。")},
{TEXT("运河坡岸被炮火破坏，残存纤道仍可通行。烟弹和炮兵联络优先配给渡口，这项安排延续至塞勒河行动。"),TEXT("Shellfire has damaged the canal banks, but the remaining towpath is still open. Smoke ammunition and artillery liaison receive priority at the crossings, continuing into the Selle operation."),TEXT("Shellfire breaks the canal banks, leaving traffic on the surviving towpath. Smoke and battery liaison receive priority at the crossing; the allocation continues into the Selle operation.")},
{TEXT("运河坡岸被炮火破坏，残存纤道仍可通行。烟弹和炮兵联络优先配给渡口，这项安排延续至塞勒河行动。"),TEXT("Shellfire has damaged the canal banks, but the remaining towpath is still open. Smoke ammunition and artillery liaison receive priority at the crossings, continuing into the Selle operation."),TEXT("Shellfire has torn the banks of the open canal, but communication must continue along the surviving towpath. Smoke ammunition and a battery liaison go first to a crossing still open; the order will follow the rearguard as far as the Selle.")},
{TEXT("SMLE 以专用发射弹抛射 No.23 枪榴弹。射手稳住支架，携弹手供应弹药；逐发装填，适合打击固定枪位。"),TEXT("The SMLE launches a No.23 grenade with a special cartridge. The gunner steadies the support while a bearer supplies rounds. Single-shot loading suits attacks on fixed gun posts."),TEXT("No.23 枪榴弹由装有发射杆和支架的 SMLE 抛射。射手需要稳定支撑与专用发射弹，携弹手在身旁照应；它不能像步枪一样连续开火。")},
{TEXT("SMLE 以专用发射弹抛射 No.23 枪榴弹。射手稳住支架，携弹手供应弹药；逐发装填，适合打击固定枪位。"),TEXT("The SMLE launches a No.23 grenade with a special cartridge. The gunner steadies the support while a bearer supplies rounds. Single-shot loading suits attacks on fixed gun posts."),TEXT("An SMLE launches the No. 23 grenade using a rod, retaining bracket and special cartridge. The gunner needs steady support and a carrier beside him. This is deliberate indirect fire, not a repeating rifle.")},
{TEXT("枪榴弹从掩护后打击近处枪位，步枪与投弹班随后接近。友军需避开弹着区。"),TEXT("Rifle grenades strike nearby posts from cover as rifles and bombers approach. Keep friendly troops clear of the impact area."),TEXT("从掩护后压住近处枪位，再让步枪与投弹班接近。不要把枪榴弹送进自己人的壕口。")},
{TEXT("枪榴弹从掩护后打击近处枪位，步枪与投弹班随后接近。友军需避开弹着区。"),TEXT("Rifle grenades strike nearby posts from cover as rifles and bombers approach. Keep friendly troops clear of the impact area."),TEXT("Suppress a nearby post from cover, then bring rifles and bombers forward. Keep rifle grenades clear of friendly trenches.")},
{TEXT("Tankgewehr M1918 架稳后逐发射击装甲。装填缓慢，命中仍可能未击穿；携弹手在旁掩护。"),TEXT("The Tankgewehr M1918 fires single rounds from a supported position. Loading is slow and a hit can fail to penetrate. The bearer guards the gunner."),TEXT("Tankgewehr M1918 以单发大口径弹对付装甲。沉重枪身必须得到支撑，装填缓慢，命中也不等于必然击穿；携弹手留在身边保护射手。")},
{TEXT("Tankgewehr M1918 架稳后逐发射击装甲。装填缓慢，命中仍可能未击穿；携弹手在旁掩护。"),TEXT("The Tankgewehr M1918 fires single rounds from a supported position. Loading is slow and a hit can fail to penetrate. The bearer guards the gunner."),TEXT("The Tankgewehr M1918 fires one heavy cartridge at a time. Support its weight, allow time to reload and remember that a hit may fail to penetrate. Keep its carrier nearby.")},
{TEXT("反坦克枪组负责迎击装甲，普通步兵保护侧翼。两人枪组需要保持距离，难以应付近处敌军。"),TEXT("Tank-rifle teams engage armour while ordinary infantry protect their flanks. The two-man crew needs distance and is vulnerable to nearby enemies."),TEXT("让反坦克枪组看住装甲接近线，以普通步兵保护侧面。保持距离与稳定阵位，别让它独自应付冲来的步兵。")},
{TEXT("反坦克枪组负责迎击装甲，普通步兵保护侧翼。两人枪组需要保持距离，难以应付近处敌军。"),TEXT("Tank-rifle teams engage armour while ordinary infantry protect their flanks. The two-man crew needs distance and is vulnerable to nearby enemies."),TEXT("反坦克枪组守住装甲接近线，普通步兵保护侧翼。两人枪组难以抵挡近距离步兵攻击。")},
{TEXT("反坦克枪组负责迎击装甲，普通步兵保护侧翼。两人枪组需要保持距离，难以应付近处敌军。"),TEXT("Tank-rifle teams engage armour while ordinary infantry protect their flanks. The two-man crew needs distance and is vulnerable to nearby enemies."),TEXT("Tank-rifle teams cover the armour approaches while ordinary infantry protect their flanks. The two-man crew is vulnerable to close infantry attacks.")},
{TEXT("反坦克枪组负责迎击装甲，普通步兵保护侧翼。两人枪组需要保持距离，难以应付近处敌军。"),TEXT("Tank-rifle teams engage armour while ordinary infantry protect their flanks. The two-man crew needs distance and is vulnerable to nearby enemies."),TEXT("Watch an armoured approach from a steady position. Ordinary infantry must protect the flanks; do not leave the heavy rifle alone against charging men.")},
